is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd waa madalkeena martigelinta iyo maaraynta bogag badan hal mar.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Booqo PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Wada hel Page Builder Sandwich Pro iyo Tranzly Pro','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Xirmadu waxay ku kacaysaa wax ka yar haddii labada furin si gooni-gooni ah loo iibsado, iyadoo qorshayaasha iyo xaddidaadaha goobtu ay isku mid yihiin.','See the bundle'=>'Arag xidhmada','Get %s'=>'Hel %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Isku-xirka wuu shaqaynayaa: %1$s iyo %2$s way wada shaqeeyaan','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s wuxuu ka shaqaynayaa boggan, markaa labada furin waxay wadaagaan hal qayb oo ah furayaasha bixiyaha AI iyo hal shaashad oo dejin ah oo iyaga loogu talagalay.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Ku turjum boggankan Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Ku dhis boggag muuqaal ahaan Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, ka socda Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Ku daabac bog kasta luuqado badan, adigoo wata ciwaano la turjumay, xogta SEO iyo badelaha luuqadda. Waxay la shaqaysaa bogagga aad halkan ku dhisatid.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Ku naqshadee boggagga isla dhexda tafatiraha adigoo isticmaalaya baloocyo dheereeya oo aan raad lahayn. Wax kasta oo aad dhisto waxaa lagu turjumaa Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s waxaa sameeyay isla kooxdaas waxayna la shaqaysaa fur-geliyehan.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Oggolow ku xiridda goobtan marka hore.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Geli cinwaan iimayl oo sax ah.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Marka hore ogolow dirista macluumaadka taageerada.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Qor mawduuc iyo farriin.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Geli cinwaanka iimaylka ee taageeradu kaaga soo jawaabi karto.','AI providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Sameeyayaasha ChatGPT. Qalab dhinac kasta u fiican.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Soo-saarayaasha Claude. Ku fiican qoraalka iyo sababaynta taxadarka leh.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Moodallada Gemini ee Google. Dheereeya oo jaban.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Shirkad sirdoonka macmalka ah (AI) oo Yurub ah oo leh noocyo degdeg ah oo qiimo jaban.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Moodello qiimahoodu jaban yahay oo ku fiican qoraalka iyo koodhka.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Hal fure oo loogu talagalay moodallada ka socda bixiyeyaal badan oo kala duwan.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Adeeg kasta oo u shaqeeya sida API-ga OpenAI, oo uu ku jiro moodeel ku shaqeynaya kombiyuutarkaaga ama server-kaaga gaarka ah.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Guud (waxaa la isticmaalaa marka aan wax gaar ah la dejin)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Qorista iyo dib-u-qorista','Translation'=>'Turjumid','Code and CSS'=>'Koodka iyo CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, laguu ma oggola inaad gasho boggan.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Habsocodyadan waxaa wadaaga gabal-daloolo kasta oo isticmaala: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Furayaashaada waxaa lagu qariyey keydka xogta ee boggan waxaana kaliya loo diraa bixiyaha aad dooratay — waligeed naloo soo ma diro anaga.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Talaabada 1 ee 2: dooro adeeg-bixiye AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Waxaad keenaysaa furahaaga gaarka ah, markaa waxaad si toos ah bixiyaha uga bixinaysaa waxaad isticmaasho. Ma hubtid? Kuwan midkoodna si fiican buu u shaqeeyaa; waxaad ku dari kartaa kuwo kale dambe.','Next'=>'Xiga','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Tallaabada 2 ee 2: ku xidh %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Geli ciwaanka adeeggaaga ku habboon OpenAI, ee ku dhammaanaya /v1. Fure waxa loo baahan yahay oo keliya haddii adeeggu mid weydiiyo.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fur %s oo gal (ama sameyso koonto bilaash ah).','the %s API keys page'=>'bogga furayaasha API ee %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Abuur fure cusub oo koobiyeey.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Hoos ku dheji oo taabo "Keydi oo tijaabi". Waxaan direynaa hal codsi oo yar si aan u hubinno inuu shaqeynayo.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Bixiyeyaasha badankood waxay u baahan yihiin xoogaa hanti/lacag ah koontada ka hor inta aan furuhu shaqeynin: %s.','add credit'=>'ku dar dhibco','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Dooro bixiye kale','Address'=>'Cinwaanka','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Furaaha la keydiyay wuxuu ku dhammaadaa …%s — dheji mid cusub si aad ugu beddesho','Key (optional)'=>'Furaha (ikhtiyaari)','API key'=>'Furaha API','Save and test'=>'Keydi oo tijaabi','Providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha','Provider'=>'Bixiye','Status'=>'Xaaladda','Key'=>'Fure','Get a key'=>'Hel fure','Test'=>'Tijaabi','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Waxaa keydiyay nooc ka cusub fur-halka: cusboonaysii fur-halkan, ama mar kale geli furaha.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Furaha la keydiyay dib dambe looma furi karo (furayaasha amniga ee goobta ayaa isbeddelay). Mar kale geli.','Not connected'=>'Kuma xirna','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ku xiran — tijaabadii ugu dambeysay waxay guuleysatay %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Tijaabadii ugu dambeysay waa fashilantay: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ku xiran — weli lama tijaabin','Which model to use'=>'Moodalka la isticmaalayo','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ waxay muujinaysaa taladayada hawshaas. Liisku wuxuu ka kooban yahay nooc kasta oo furahaagu isticmaali karo, oo si toos ah looga akhriyay bixiyaha.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Waxaa lagula talinayaa bixiyaha —','Save models'=>'Kaydi moodallada','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Ka cusbooneysii liisaska moodeellada bixiyeyaasha','Images'=>'Sawirrada','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Ku xir OpenAI ama Google Gemini si aad sawirro u sameyso.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka sawirka ugu cusub ee bixiyaha koowaad ee ku xiran —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Raadinta goobta (gellinta)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter si aad u samaysato tusmada raadinta ee goobtaada.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka ugu dambeeyay ee geynta ee bixiyaha koowaad ee ku xiran —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Bedelitaanka tan waxay dib u dhisaysaa tusmada raadinta ee furin kasta oo isticmaala.','best quality'=>'Tayada ugu fiican','lowest cost'=>'Qiimaha ugu hooseeya','fastest'=>'Ugu dhaqsiyaha badan','Add a model yourself'=>'Adigu nooc ku dar','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Moodal cusub ma maanta ayaa soo baxay? Ku dheji magaciisa saxda ah si aad isla markiiba u isticmaasho.','Model name'=>'Magaca moodeelka','Add model'=>'Ku dar moodel','Recommended models list'=>'Liiska moodallada lagu taliyay','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Liiska noocyada lagu taliyay lama xaqiijin karin, sidaas darteed wax talo bixin ah lama muujinayo. Dib u rakib furaha (plugin), ama hoos ka shid cusboonaysiinta maalinlaha ah.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Liiska la isticmaalayo waxaa la daabacay %s. Cusbooneysiin kasta oo furin ah waxay keenaysaa mid cusub.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Sidoo kale ka hubi Zinn Digital® hal mar maalintii liis la cusboonaysiiyay.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Kaliya codsi fudud oo soo dejin ah ayaa la diraa: ma jiro fure, ma jiro cinwaan goobeed, waxba kama jiraan waxa ku jira nuxurkaaga. Liisku wuu saxiixan yahay, liiskii ku guuldareysta hubinta saxiixana waa la iska indhatiraa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Markii ugu dambeysay ee la hubiyay %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Keydi, oo hadda hubi haddii la shiday','a newer list was installed'=>'Liis ka cusub ayaa la rakibay','already up to date'=>'horey loo cusbooneysiiyay','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'Soo dejintu waxay ku guuldarraysatay hubinta saxiixa waana la iska indhatiray','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Lama xiriiri karin Zinn Digital®; liiska hadda jira ayaa sii shaqeynaya','turned off'=>'daran','Open'=>'Fur','Check their status page'=>'Hubi boggoda xaaladda','Open your billing page'=>'Fur boggaaga qaansheegta','Open your API keys page'=>'Fur bogga furayaashaada API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fur habaynta AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, laguu ma oggola inaad taas samayso.','Unknown provider.'=>'Bixiye aan la garanayn.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Geli ciwaanka adeeggaaga, tusaale ahaan http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Taasi uma eka furaha API. Mar kale soo koobiyeey, adigoo aan meel bannaan ku darin.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Horta geli furahaaga API.','Key removed.'=>'Furaha waa laga saaray.','Models saved.'=>'Moodallada waa la keydiyay.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Geli magaca saxda ah ee nooca, tusaale ahaan sida ku qoran dukumeentiga bixiyaha.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'Waxaa lagu daray %s. Ka dooro qaybta hoose ee "Qaabkee la isticmaalayaa".','Model removed.'=>'Moodalka waa la saaray.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Cusbooneysiinta maalinlaha ah waa dansan tahay. Waxaa la isticmaalayaa liiska la socday furka.','Checked: %s.'=>'La hubiyey: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Liisaska moodeellada waa la cusbooneysiiyay.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Furahaaga AI waxaa keydiyay nooc ka cusub mid ka mid ah furayaashaaga wax-ku-kordinta. Cusbooneysii furahaan wax-ku-kordinta, ama mar kale furaha geli goobaha AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Furahaaga AI ee la keydiyay lama furi karo mar dambe (furayaasha amniga ee goobta ayaa isbeddelay). Dib ugu geli xulashooyinka AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI weli lama habaynin. Ku dar fure bixiyaha AI goobaha AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Lama dooran qaab hawshan loogu talagalay. Mid ka dooro goobaha AI-ga.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bixiyahaas AI laguma taageero noocaan furaha ah.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro bixiye AI oo sawirro samayn kara oo ku xiran. Ku dar furaha OpenAI ama Google Gemini meesha habaynta AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bixiyahan AI ma abuuri karo sawirro. Dooro OpenAI ama Google Gemini sawirrada ku jira habaynta AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo nooc kasta oo muuqaal ah. Ka hubi rukhsadaha furaha bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale oo sawirrada ah.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro bixiye AI oo ku xiran oo dhisi kara tusmada raadinta. Ku dar furaha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter goobaha AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo nooc kasta oo embedding ah. Ka hubi rukhsadaha furaha bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale oo loogu talagalay raadinta bogga.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Bixiyahan AI ma dhisi karo tusmada raadinta. Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama adeeg la jaanqaadi kara si aad goobta uga raadiso.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Boggani ma gaari karin adeeggaaga AI. Hubi inuu shaqeynayo iyo in cinwaankiisa laga heli karo server-kaaga shabakadda (adeeg ku yaal kombiyuutarkaaga lagama heli karo bog martigelin ah).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Boggani ma gaari karin %s. Hubi bogga xaaladdooda; haddii ay shaqeynayaan, hoygaaga ayaa laga yaabaa inuu xannibayo xiriirrada baxaya, ama ciwaanka ayaa khaldan.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s wuxuu sheegayaa in akoonkaagu uusan lahayn wax hareeyey ama kooto ah. Ku dar hareeyey ama kor u qaad xadkaaga akoonka aad ku leedahay iyaga, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s ma aqbalin furahaaga. Waxaa laga yaabaa in si khaldan loo qoray, la baab\'iyay ama uu dhacay. Samee fure cusub oo halkan ku dheji.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s wuxuu diiday codsigan furahaaga. Furuhu waxa laga yaabaa inuusan geli karin qaabkan ama muuqaalkan, ama akoonkaagu wuxuu u baahan yahay xaqiijin.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Qaabka "%1$s" lagama heli karo %2$s furahaaga. Dooro qaab kale dejinta AI-ga.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Qorshahaaga %2$s kuma jiro qaabka "%1$s". Dooro qaab kale gudaha habaynta AI, ama la cusboonaysii qorshahaaga iyaga.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s wuxuu xaddidayaa xawaaraha furahaagu ku diri karo codsiyada. Sug daqiiqad oo mar kale isku day, ama la kordhi xadka heerkaaga iyaga.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s dhibaatooyin ayaa hadda haysta (cilad ama culays xad-dhaaf ah oo xaggooda ah). Wax dhib ah kuma jiraan habayntaada. Wax yar ka dib mar kale isku day.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Codsiga AI wuu fashilmay sabab aanan garan karin. Isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii dhacdo, la xiriir taageerada oo u dir macluumaadka hoose.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Bixiyaha AI wuxuu ku jawaabay qaab aysan balag-lahaani akhrin karin. Fadlan isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii socoto, dooro nooc kale ama la xiriir taageerada.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Hagaajin (la jaanqaadi karta OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Marka hore furaha u kaydi bixiyahan.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Furahaagu wuu shaqaynayaa, laakiin bixiyuhu ma qorin wax qaab qoraal ah oo loogu talagalay. Hoos adigu qaab ku dar.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Waa lagu xidhay. %1$s waxa uu kaga jawaabay %2$s. Astaamahaaga AI waxay diyaar u yihiin in la isticmaalo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Doorkaaga isticmaale looma oggola inuu AI ku isticmaalo goobtan. Weydii maamulaha.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Boggani wuxuu gaaray xaddidkiisa kharashka AI ee bishii. Maamuluhu wuxuu ku kordhin karaa goobaha AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Boggani wuxuu gaaray xadka bishii ee codsiyada AI. Maamuluhu wuxuu ku kordhin karaa goobaha AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Isticmaalka iyo kharashka','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Diiwaanka, xuduudaha iyo rukhsadaha doorka waxay khuseeyaan AI-da loo isticmaalo: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kharashyadu waa qiyaas, waxaana laga xisaabiyay qiimayaasha la daabacay; moodalka aan qiimihiisa la garanayn waxa loo tiriyaa eber.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Bishan: %1$s codsi, qiyaastii %2$s.','When'=>'Goorta','Who'=>'Yaa','Used for'=>'Loo adeegsaday','Model'=>'Nooc','Tokens in / out'=>'Astaamaha soo galaya / baxaya','About'=>'Ku saabsan','Result'=>'Natiijo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Weli wax codsiyo AI ah lama samayn.','Done'=>'Dhammaystir','Limits and permissions'=>'Xaddidaadaha iyo oggolaanshaha','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Xadka kharashka bishii (Doolarka US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Faaruq uga tag haddii aadan xad rabin. AI-gu wuu joogsanayaa bisha inta ka dhiman marka kharashka qiyaasta ahi uu gaaro.','Monthly request limit'=>'Xadka codsiyada bishii','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bannaan uga tag si aan xad lahayn.','Who may use AI'=>'Yaa isticmaali kara AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Ha calaamadeynin midna si aad qof kasta oo isticmaali kara astaamaha fur-furaha ugu oggolaato inuu isticmaalo AI. Maamulayaashu mar walba way isticmaali karaan.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Keydi xaddidyada iyo oggolaanshaha','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Xadka iyo oggolaanshaha waa la keydiyay.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Luuqadaasi ma aha mid ka mid ah luuqadaha boggan.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Turjumaaddu waa inay noqotaa nooc nuxur la mid ah kan asalka ah.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Dooro mid ka mid ah luuqadaha kale ee bogga.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Qoraallada shaashadda maamulka ayaa ka maqan koobiyigan fur-in-ka. Dib uga soo deji xirmada la sii daayay.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Shaashaddan waxay u baahan tahay JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Dooro luuqad','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Macaamiil martigelin ah? Ka hel %1$d%% dhimis %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Macaamiil ahaan adeegga martigelinta ee Zinn Digital®, waxaad helaysaa koodh gaar ah oo loogu talagalay %d%% dhimis ah lacag-bixintaada koowaad. Cusboonaysiintu waxay ku soconaysaa qiimaha caadiga ah.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Hel koodkayga %d%% oo u gudub bixinta','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Qiimo-dhimistani waxay u gaar tahay macaamiisha haysta qorshe martigelinta (hosting) oo lacag ah oo xaaladdiisu wanaagsan tahay. Tijaabooyinka bilaashka ahi kuma jiraan.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Horay ayaad u isticmaashay qiimo dhimista macaamiisha martigelinta ee qalabkan.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hadda ma aannu heli karin koodhkaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Horgalaha waa inuu ahaadaa 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yaryar ama nambaro, ku bilaabmaa xaraf, waana inuusan magacaabin furaha.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" ma aha koodhka luuqadda. Isticmaal WordPress locale sida fr_FR ama de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Liis garee ugu yaraan hal luqad.','Translations'=>'Turjumaadaha','Edit the %s version'=>'Wax ka beddel nooca %s','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'Ibarbardhig nooca %s dhinac ilaa dhinac','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'Qoraal beddel ah','Caption'=>'Qoraal kooban','Title'=>'Cinwaan','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'Dooro mid ka mid ah menu-yadaada luqad kasta.','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Marka hore kaydi qoraalkan, ka dibna halkan ku turjun.','This one'=>'Kani','Edit'=>'Wax ka beddel','Side by side'=>'Dhinac kasta','Translate again'=>'Turjun mar kale','Translate'=>'Turjun','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'Samee koobi si aad gacanta ugu turjunto','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'Turjumaaddu waxay isticmaashaa mishiinka loo dejiyay luuqadaas. Nooc uu qof wax ka beddelay waligii laguma dul qoro.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Loma oggola inaad turjunto sheygan.','%s: translated.'=>'%s: waa la tarjumay.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'Tani ma aha turjumid, markaa ma jiraan wax la ilaaliyo.','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'Mawduuca noocan ah lama turjumin.','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'Qoraalka %s kuma jiro goobtan dambe. Dib u soo geli bogga.','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'Dooro mid ka mid ah luuqadahaaga kale.','Compare translation'=>'Isbarbardhig tarjumaadda','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'Loma oggola inaad wax ka beddesho turjumaaddan.','This piece now contains formatting. Reload the page to edit it.'=>'Qaybtani hadda waxay ka kooban tahay qaabayn. Dib u soo geli bogga si aad wax uga beddesho.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'Kani ma aha turjumid, markaa ma jiraan wax la barbar dhigo.','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'Asalka turjumaddan mar dambe ma jiro.','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'Qaybta %s kama mid aha turjumaddan mar dambe. Dib u soo geli bogga oo mar kale isku day.','Translate on this page'=>'Ku turjun boggan','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Shaygan horey ayuu ugu lahaa nooc luuqadaas ah.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Mashiinkaas turjumaada lagama heli karo boggan.','Different engines and AI models per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Matoorro iyo habab AI oo kala duwan luqad kasta, dib-u-dhac toos ah iyo xaddidaadaha kharashka waa astaamaha Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Turjumaadaha la doorbido iyo hab-dhaca luuqad kasta waa astaamo u gaar ah Tranzly Pro. Liiska ereyada aan la turjumayn waa bilaash.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Qiimaha %s ma aha mid ka mid ah xulashooyinka la oggol yahay.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Safka gadaale kama heli karo boggan.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Shaqada tarjumaadda waxay ku socotaa qofka bilaabay ahaan, markaa waa in isticmaaluhu soo galo.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Ma jiraan wax laguu oggol yahay inaad ku turjunto doorashadaas.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Sheygaasi kama mid aha shaqo tarjumaad.','That item is already translated, so there is nothing to retry. To retry every failed item of a job, run wp tranzly jobs retry-failed with the job ID, or retry each one from the job\'s list of what failed.'=>'Sheygaas mar hore ayaa la turjumay, sidaas darteed wax dib loo isku dayo ma jiraan. Si aad dib ugu tijaabiso shay kasta oo shaqo ku guuldareystay, ku socodsii wp tranzly jobs retry-failed aqoonsiga shaqada (job ID), ama mid kasta dib uga tijaabi liiska shaqada ee waxyaabihii guuldareystay.','That item is already waiting to be translated.'=>'Sheygaas durba wuxuu sugayaa in la turjumo.','There is no translation job with that ID.'=>'Ma jiro shaqo turjumid ah oo wadata aqoonsigaas (ID).','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Lamaad ogola in aad bedesho tarjumaadaas.','Translating this item stopped with an error in WordPress or another plugin. The details are below; retry it once the cause is fixed.'=>'Turjumidda shaygan waxay ku istaagtay khalad ka dhacay WordPress ama plugin kale. Faahfaahinta hoos ayaa lagu xusay; dib isku day marka sababta la xalliyo.','Tranzly is not set up on this site.'=>'Tranzly lagama habeynin goobtan.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Kooxda shaygan waxay horey u leedahay nooca %1$s (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Shay ma noqon karo tarjumaaddiisa.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Shaygaasi mar horeba waa turjumaada wax kale. Marka hore ka saar xiriirinta.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Xiriirinta tarjumaadda lama keydin karin.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Qoraalkaas halkan laguma turjumi karo.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Qoraalkaas warbaahinta halkan laguma tarjumi karo.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Turjumaad waa la daabaci karaa ama waxaa loo hayn karaa qabyo ahaan.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Loma oggola inaad daabacdo noocan nuxurka ah.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Shaygan mar horeba waxaa lagu qoray luuqadaas.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Turjumaadan waxaa wax ka beddelay qof (ama waa la soo dhoofiyay), sidaas darteed waa la ilaaliyay. Fur si aad mar kale u turjunto.','That item does not exist.'=>'Sheygaasi ma jiro.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Weli ma jirto matoor turjumaad oo la habeeyay. Ku dar fure mid ka mid ah Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Mashiinkaas turjumaadda weli lama habeynin: marka hore ku dar furihiisa.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Qoraalkan oo kale ayaa hadda shaqo kale turjumaysaa; shaygani wuxuu isticmaali doonaa jawaabtaas.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Ma jiro matoor turjumaad oo qaadi kara shaygan.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Mashiinku ma soo celin turjumaadda qayb kasta oo ka mid ah shaygan. Waxba lama beddelin.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Luqad kasta waa inay noqotaa mid ka mid ah luqadaha goobta, iyadoo leh matoor la heli karo.','Each language\'s AI model must name one of the site\'s languages (or all other languages), an AI provider and one of its models.'=>'Qaab-dhismeedka AI ee luqad kasta waa inuu magacaabaa mid ka mid ah luqadaha goobta (ama dhammaan luqadaha kale), adeeg-bixiye AI iyo mid ka mid ah moodalladiisa.','%1$s is not one of the models of %2$s. Pick one from the list, or add it in the AI settings first.'=>'%1$s kama mid aha moodallada %2$s. Mid ka dooro liiska, ama marka hore ku dar goobaha AI-ga.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Liiska beddelka ahi wuxuu magacaabi karaa oo keliya matoorrada la heli karo.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Xadka bishiiba waa qaddar doolarka US ah, eber ama ka badan, oo loogu talagalay matoor la heli karo.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Gelitaannada qaamuuska waa in lagu kooxeeyaa mid ka mid ah luuqadaha bogga.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Codka waxa loo dejiyaa luqadda goobta kasta: qaabka rasmiga ah ee caadiga ah, in ka badan ama ka yar, oo lagu daray tilmaamo ikhtiyaari ah.','AI model'=>'Qaabka AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Qaabka AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s wuxuu hadda la kulmayaa dhibaatooyin. Isku day mar dhow mar kale, ama isticmaal matoor kale.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Boggaagu ma gaari karin %s. Hubi inuu sameyn karo xiriirro dibadda ah, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s ma aqbalin furahaaga API. Ka hubi furaha Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Koontadaada %s waxay dhamaysatay kootadeedii ama haraageedii. Kula buuxi xaggooda, ama isticmaal matoor kale.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s wuxuu naga codsaday inaan tartiibino. Si toos ah ayaa mar kale la isugu dayi doonaa.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Qoraalkani aad buu ugu dheer yahay %s hal mar. Qaybi nuxurka, ama isticmaal matoor kale.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s wuxuu diiday inuu turjumo nuxurkan. Isku day matoor kale, ama gacanta ku turjun.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s ma turjumo luuqaddan. U dooro mishiin kale.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'Xadka kharashka bishan ee %s waa la gaaray, sidaas darteed wax dambe looma dirin. Kordhi xadka gudaha Tranzly → Engines, ama sug ilaa bisha dambe.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Turjumaadda lagu sameeyay %s way fashilantay sabab Tranzly aanu aqoonsan karin. Hoos ka eeg faahfaahin.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Aqoonsiga mashiinka (engine id) waa inuu ahaadaa xarfo yaryar, tirooyin iyo xariiqo.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'furaha shatiga','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Isticmaale wali lama xiriirin shatiga, taas oo lagama maarmaan u ah ka hortagga hawlgelinta aan la oggolayn. Si aad shatiga ugu meelayso isticmaalahaaga, waxaad oggolaatay inaad la wadaagto magaca buuxa iyo ciwaanka iimaylka ee isticmaalahaaga WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'boggaga kor ku xusan','Account'=>'Koonto','Account Details'=>'Faahfaahinta Koontada','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Koontu waxay sugaysaa hawlgelin. Fadlan hubi iimaylkaaga oo guji xidhiidhka si aad u hawlgeliso koontadaada ka dibna mar kale soo gudbi foomka bahwadaagta.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ma jeclaan lahayd inaad ku darto %1$s gudaha %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ficilada','Activate'=>'Hawlgeli','Activate Free Version'=>'Hawlgeli Nooca Bilaashka ah','Activate License'=>'Kici Shatiga','activate a license here'=>'Halkan kaga hawlgal shatiga','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Fadlan geli furaha shatiga ee aad ku heshay iimaylka isla marka aad iibsatay ka dib:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Ka hawlgeli shatiga dhammaan boggaga shabakadda.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Ka hawlgeli shatiga dhammaan bogagga sugaya.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' Nooca lacagta lagu bixiyo ee %1$s mar hore ayaa la rakibay. Fadlan shaqaysii si aad uga faa\'iidaysato astaamaha %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' Nooca lacag-bixinta ah ee %1$s mar hore ayaa la rakibay. Fadlan u gudub %2$s si aad u hawlgeliso oo aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga astaamaha %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kow hawlgeli kordhintan','Activate %s'=>'Hawlgeli %s','Activate %s features'=>'Hawlgeli astaamaha %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Dhammeystir Kicinta "%s" Hadda','Activate %s Plan'=>'Hawlgeli Qorshaha %s','Activated'=>'La hawlgeliyay','Activating'=>'Hawlgelinaya','Activating license'=>'Hawlgelinta shatiga','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Koontadaada si guul leh ayaa loogu hawlgeliyay qorshaha %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Firfircoon','Add another domain'=>'Ku dar domain kale','Add-Ons'=>'Kordhinta','Add Ons for %s'=>'Ku-darka loogu talagalay %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Ma aannu awoodin inaan soo rarno liiska waxyaabaha lagu kordhiyo. Waxay u badan tahay inay tahay cilad dhankayaga ah, fadlan isku day inaad dib ugu soo laabato dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','Add-On'=>'Kordhin','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s waa kordhin lacag kaliya ah (premium). Waa inaad marka hore iibsataa ruqsad ka hor inta aanad shaqaysiin fur-halka (plugin).','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'Kordhinta %s si guul leh ayaa loo iibsaday.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Qorshahaaga dheeriga ah ee %s si guul leh ayaa loo cusbooneysiiyay.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Tijaabadii bilaashka ahayd ee %s si guul leh ayaa loo joojiyay. Maadaama kordhintu ay tahay mid qaali ah (premium) oo keliya, si toos ah ayaa loo demiyay. Haddii aad jeceshahay inaad mustaqbalka isticmaasho, waa inaad iibsataa ruqsad.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ma shaqayn karo fur-haye la\'aantiis.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ma shaqayn karo la\'aanta %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Waxaan kaliya ku ogeysiinaynaa in xogta ku-darka ah ee %s laga soo qaadanayo adeeg bixiye dibadeed.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Kudarada qaybta %s','Address Line %d'=>'Sadarka Ciwaanka %d','Affiliate'=>'Bah-wadaag','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sababo la xiriira jebinta shuruudahayaga xiriirka, waxaan go\'aansanay inaan si ku meel gaar ah u xannibno koontadaada xiriirka. Haddii aad wax su\'aalo ah qabtid, fadlan la xiriir kooxda taageerada.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Koontadaada xiriirka waxaa si ku meel gaar ah loo hakiyay.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Codsigaagii ku-xirnaanshaha ee %1$s waa la aqbalay! Gal aaggaaga ku-xirnaanshaha ee: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay codsigaaga barnaamijkeenna shuraakada, nasiib-darro, waxaan xilligan go\'aansannay inaan diidno codsigaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale 30 maalmood ka dib.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay codsigaaga ku aaddan barnaamijkeenna shuraakada, waxaan dib u eegi doonnaa faahfaahintaada 14-ka maalmood ee soo socda gudahooda waxaana kula soo xiriiri doonnaa xog dheeraad ah.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s kookiga dabagalka booqashada koowaad kadib si loo kordhiyo fursadda dakhli-abuurka.','Affiliation'=>'Xiriir','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Marka uu shatigaagu dhaco waxaad wali isticmaali kartaa nooca Bilaashka ah laakiin MA heli doontid astaamaha %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Marka uu shatigaagu dhaco ma awoodi doontid inaad isticmaasho %s, ilaa aad mar kale ku hawlgeliso shati cayiman oo shaqaynaya mooyaane.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Weli waxaad ku raaxaysan kartaa dhammaan astaamaha %1$s laakiin ma heli doontid cusboonaysiinta amniga & astaamaha %2$s, sidoo kale taageero ma heli doontid.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay cusboonaysiinta.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'%1$s-kaaga bilaashka ah ka dib, bixi ugu yaraan %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Oggolow oo Dhaqaaji Shatiga','I Agree - Change User'=>'Waan Oggolahay - Beddel Isticmaalaha','All Requests'=>'Dhammaan Codsiyada','All Types'=>'Dhammaan Noocyada','allow'=>'Oggolow','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Horey ayaad uga mid noqotay dabagalka isticmaalka naga caawiya inaan sii wadno hagaajinta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Waxaad mar horeba oggolaatay la-socodka adeegsigeenna, kaas oo naga caawiya inaan sii wadno hagaajintooda.','Amount'=>'Qaddarka','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Sannadle ah','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Sannad kasta','Anonymous feedback'=>'Faallo qarsoodi ah','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Ku dabaq dhammaan bogagga ku jira shabakadda.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Ku dabaq dhammaan boggaga sugaya.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Codso si aad xubin uga noqoto barnaamijka shuraakada','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Oggolow oo Bilow Tijaabada','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Fadlan noo sheeg sababta si aan wax uga horumarino.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli ciwaanka iimaylka aad u isticmaashay cusboonaysiinta xagga hoose, waxaanan dib kuugu soo diri doonnaa furaha shatiga.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli ciwaanka iimaylka aad isticmaashay intii aad wax iibsanaysay waxaanan dib kuugu soo diri doonnaa furaha shatiga.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Ku xidh akoonka mulkiilaha shatiga.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Qoraa','Invalid module ID.'=>'Aqoonsiga module-ka oo aan sax ahayn.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ma haysatid shati sax ah oo aad ku geli karto nooca qiimaha sare leh.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Rakibaadda tooska ah waxay u shaqaysaa oo keliya dadka doortay inay ka qaybqaataan.','Premium version already active.'=>'Nooca qiimaha leh mar horeba waa shaqaynayaa.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Nooca dheeraadka ah ee qiimaha leh mar hore ayaa la rakibay.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Furaha kordhinta (plugin) waa "Serviceware", taasoo macnaheedu yahay inuusan lahayn nooc koodhka lacagta ah (premium).','Automatic Installation'=>'Rakibaad toos ah','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Si toos ah u deminaaya:','Average Rating'=>'Qiimaynta Celceliska ah','Awesome'=>'Cajiib','based on %s'=>'ku salaysan %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Noqo xubin shuraako ah','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Maka heshay %s? Noqo danjirahayaga oo lacag kasbo ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Ilaahay nabad ha idin siiyo, ma ogtahay in %1$s uu leeyahay barnaamij affiliate ah? Haddii aad jeceshahay %2$s waxaad noqon kartaa safiirkayaga oo aad kasban kartaa xoogaa lacag ah!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Ugu fiican','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta nooca Beta waxay ku beddeli doontaa noocaagii %s ee rakibnaa nooca ugu dambeeyay ee Beta - u isticmaal si taxadar leh, oo ha ku isticmaalin goobaha shaqada tooska ah ku jira. Waa laguu digay.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'Laga qaaday %s','Billing'=>'Biilasha','Billing & Invoices'=>'Qaansheegashada & Biilasha','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'La xannibay','Blocking'=>'Xannibaya','Blog ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Blog-ka','Body'=>'Qoraalka','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Haa - labada ciwaanba anigaa iska leh','Bundle'=>'Xidhmo','Bundle Plan'=>'Qorshaha Xidhmada','Business name'=>'Magaca ganacsiga','Buy license'=>'Iibso shatiga','Buy a license now'=>'Iibso shatiga hadda','Cancel'=>'Kansal garee','Cancel Installation'=>'Jooji Rakibaadda','Cancel Subscription'=>'Jooji Diiwaangelinta','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Haddii aadan qorshaynayn inaad ku isticmaasho %1$s-kan goobtan (ama goob kale) - ma jeclaan lahayd inaad sidoo kale joojiso %2$s?','Cancel Trial'=>'Jooji Tijaabada','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Joojinta tijaabada waxay isla markiiba xannibi doontaa gelitaanka dhammaan astaamaha qaaliga ah. Ma hubtaa?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Jooji %s oo Sii wad','Cancelled'=>'Waa la baajiyay','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Joojinta rukummada','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ma heli kartid furahaaga shatiga?','Change License'=>'Beddel Shatiga','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Iimayl xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Waa inaad ku xaqiijisaa cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota gudahooda. Haddii aadan heli karin iimaylka, fadlan hubi galkaaga spam-ka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Iimayl xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Mulkiilaha iimaylka waa inuu ku xaqiijiyaa cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota gudahooda.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s waa mulkiilaha cusub ee koontada.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay xaqiijinta beddelka lahaanshaha. Iimayl ayaa hadda loo diray %s si loo helo oggolaanshaha ugu dambeeya.','Change Ownership'=>'Beddel Lahaanshaha','Change Plan'=>'Beddel Qorshaha','Change User'=>'Beddel Isticmaalaha','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Marka aad beddesho isticmaalaha, waxaad oggolaanaysaa inaad lahaanshaha akoonka ku wareejiso:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Diiwaanka isbeddelka','Changing user, please wait'=>'Beddelidda isticmaalaha, fadlan sug','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Haddii aadan helin iimaylka, isku day inaad hubiso galkaaga spam-ka ama raadi iimayllada ka yimid %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Bixi lacagta','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Dooro ilaa %s degel si aad shatiga uga hawlgeliso.','City'=>'Magaalada','Clear API Cache'=>'Nadiifi Kaydka API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Nadiifi Xogaha Ku-meel-gaarka ah ee Cusbooneysiinta','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Guji halkan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Guji halkan si aad fur-galka ugu isticmaasho si qarsoodi ah','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Guji si aad u aragto dib-u-eegisyada bixiyay qiimeynta %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s waa cinwaanka iimaylka macmiilkayga','Code'=>'Kood','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'%s komishan ah marka macamiilku iibsado shati cusub.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Maadaama aan u heyno 30 maalmood lacag-celinta suurtagalka ah, waxaan kaliya bixinaa komishannada ka weyn 30 maalmood.','Communication'=>'Xiriirka','Compatible up to'=>'La jaanqaadi kara ilaa','complete the opt-in'=>'dhammaystir ka-qaybgalka dookha ah','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hambalyo','Never miss an important update'=>'Waligaa ha seegin warbixin muhiim ah','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay cusboonaysiinta %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Dooro inaad hesho ogeysiisyada iimaylka ee cusboonaysiinta amniga & astaamaha, nuxurka waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada mararka qaarkood, iyo inaad wadaagto xoogaa macluumaad aasaasi ah oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress. Tani waxay naga caawin doontaa inaan %s ka dhigno mid aad ula jaanqaada boggaaga oo si fiican u qabata waxaad u baahan tahay.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Ku biir si aad u hesho ogeysiisyo iimayl oo ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, waxyaabo waxbarasho, iyo dalabyo mararka qaar, oo aad la wadaagto macluumaad guud oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Haddii aad tan ka gudubto, wax dhib ah ma leh! %1$s wali si fiican ayuu u shaqayn doonaa.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Waxaan soo kordhinnay doorashadan si aadan waligaa u seegin cusbooneysiin muhiim ah oo aad nooga caawiso inaan %s ka dhigno mid ku habboon bartaada oo si fiican u qabata waxaad u baahan tahay.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Waxaan ku faraxsanahay inaan soo bandhigno isku-xirka heerka shabakadda ee Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Intii lagu guda jiray habka cusboonaysiinta waxaan shabakadda dhexdeeda ku ogaannay %s goob(ood) oo weli u baahan dareenkaaga.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Intii lagu jiray hannaanka cusboonaysiinta waxaan ogaannay %d degel oo weli sugaya hawlgelinta shatiga.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad %s ku isticmaasho boggagaas, fadlan hoos geli furahaaga shatiga oo guji badhanka hawlgelinta.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Haddii kale, hadda waad ka boodi kartaa oo waxaad shatiga dhaqaajin kartaa hadhow, adiga oo ka dhex shaqaysiinaya bogga Koontada heerka-shabakadeed ee %s-kaaga.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ku xiran','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Marka aad dhammayso, demi %s ka dibna mar kale shid.','Contact'=>'La xiriir','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Fadlan nala socodsii haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaan kula soo xiriirno wixii ku saabsan cusbooneysiinta amniga & muuqaallada c