inka','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Hawlgelinaya','as software licenseLicense'=>'Shatiga','close a windowDismiss'=>'Diid','close windowDismiss'=>'Diid','like websitesSites'=>'Goobaha','nounPricing'=>'Qiimaha','trial periodTrial'=>'Tijaabo','verbOpt In'=>'Ka Qaybgal','verbOpt Out'=>'Ka bax','verbSkip'=>'Ka bood','verbUpgrade'=>'Casriyeey','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s kahor','Blocks with repeated items, and synced patterns'=>'Baloogyo leh walxo soo noqnoqda, iyo qaabab la iswaafajiyay','WooCommerce products'=>'Badeecadaha WooCommerce','Comments and reviews'=>'Faallooyin iyo dib u eegisyo','Translated automatically from %s.'=>'Waxaa si toos ah looga soo tarjumay %s.','WooCommerce currencies'=>'Lacagaha WooCommerce','Currency'=>'Lacagta','The rate source does not quote %s, the shop\'s currency.'=>'Xigashada heerka ma soo xiganayso %s, lacagta dukaanka.','"%s" is not a currency WooCommerce knows, or it is the shop\'s own currency.'=>'"%s" ma aha lacag WooCommerce uu yaqaano, ama waa lacagta rasmiga ah ee dukaanka.','Enter a rate above zero for %s, like 0.92.'=>'Geli heer ka sarreeya eber ee %s, sida 0.92.','Rounding steps and price endings are amounts, like 0.05 or 0.99.'=>'Tallaabooyinka wareejinta iyo dhammaadka qiimaha waa lacago, sida 0.05 ama 0.99.','Custom fields (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)'=>'Goobaha gaarka ah (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)','Choose translate, copy or leave empty for each field.'=>'Dooro turjun, koobi garee ama bannaan uga tag goob kasta.','Forms (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)'=>'Foomamka (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)','I enter the rates myself'=>'Aniga ayaa qiimaha geliya','European Central Bank, updated daily (free, no account needed)'=>'Bangiga Dhexe ee Yurub, maalin kasta la cusbooneysiiyo (bilaash, koonto looma baahna)','The European Central Bank answered %d. The last rates are kept.'=>'Bangiga Dhexe ee Yurub wuxuu ku jawaabay %d. Heerarkii ugu dambeeyay waa la hayaa.','The European Central Bank\'s feed held no rates. The last rates are kept.'=>'Qulqulka Bangiga Dhexe ee Yurub ma lahayn wax sarif ah. Sarifyadii ugu dambeeyay waa la haynayaa.','That exchange-rate source is not available.'=>'Xigashadaas sarifka lacagta ma heli karto.','SEO plugins (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)'=>'Furayaasha SEO (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)','Theme and plugin text'=>'Qoraalka dulucda iyo fur-hawaalaha','That theme or plugin is not active on this site.'=>'Mowduucaas ama furahaas kama shaqeynayo boggan.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Falka lama dhamaystiri karin. Fadlan isku day mar kale, haddii ay weli shaqayn weydana, la xiriir maamulaha goobta.','Connect an AI app'=>'Ku xidh barnaamijka AI','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Codsigan isku-xirka wuu dhacay. Ku noqo abka oo mar kale bilow isku-xirka.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s wuxuu codsanayaa inuu ku isticmaalo %2$s goobtan ahaan %3$s. Waxa kaliya ee uu samayn karaa waa waxa akoonkaaga WordPress loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo, waxaanad ka jari kartaa wakhti kasta goobaha habaynta ee wakiilada AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s wuxuu iska soo aqoonsaday %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s si toos ah ayuu isu diiwaangeliyay. Kaliya sii wad haddii aad tan ka bilowday %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Koontadaadu ma isticmaali karto aaladahaan boggan. Weydii maamulaha.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Ka dib markaad jawaabto waxaad ku noqon doontaa %s.','Allow %s'=>'Oggolow %s','Do not allow'=>'Ha oggolaan','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Qiimo loo baahnaa ayaa maqan ama qaab khaldan ku jira. Hubi qaab-dhismeedka gelinta awoodda.','The site refused the request.'=>'Boggu wuxuu diiday codsigii.','Unknown tool.'=>'Qalab aan la garanayn.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakiillada AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'U oggolow caawiyeyaasha AI sida Claude, Cursor ama VS Code inay boggan kaaga shaqeeyaan iyagoo adeegsanaya MCP (Model Context Protocol). Waxay u galaan sidii isticmaale WordPress ah (Claude iyo ChatGPT adoo halkan ku ansixinaya, kuwa kalena lambarka sirta ah ee abka) waxayna qaban karaan oo keliya waxa isticmaalahaas loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakiilada AI waxay u baahan yihiin WordPress 6.9 ama ka dambeeya. Cusboonaysii WordPress si aad u isticmaasho.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Oggolow wakiilada AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Dami: aaladaha hoose iyo waddooyinkooda REST gabi ahaanba ma diiwaangashana.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirka (barta ugu dambaysa ee MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude iyo ChatGPT: taa beddelkeeda soo gal','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ku dar ciwaanka xiriirka xiriiriye gaar ah Claude, ama ahaan barnaamij ahaan habka horumariyaha ChatGPT. Waxay furaan goobtan si aad u ansixiso; ma jiro eray sir ah oo la koobiyeeyo.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Barnaamijyada AI ee ku xiran koontadaada:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Barnaamijyada kale ee AI: furaha sirta ah ee dalabka','Create an application password for your user'=>'U samee furaha sirta ah ee abka isticmaalahaaga','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ku dar tan habaynta MCP ee abkaaga AI, adigoo wata magacaaga isticmaale iyo furahaas sirta ah:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: geli gelitaanka isku midka ah hoosta "servers" ee ku jira .vscode/mcp.json, ee ha gelin hoosta "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Aaladaha wakiilka AI uu halkan ku isticmaali karo (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha: Wakiilada AI iyo MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dukumentiyada soo-saaraha: awoodaha, REST iyo MCP','Translate this site\'s content and check its translations with Tranzly.'=>'Turjun nuxurka goobtan oo ku hubi turjumaannadeeda Tranzly.','Languages, translation and translation status.'=>'Luuqadaha, turjumaadda iyo xaaladda turjumaadda.','List languages'=>'Liis garee luuqadaha','Lists the site\'s languages. The first one is the language the original content is written in.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa luuqadaha goobta. Midka koowaad waa luuqadda lagu qoray nuxurka asalka ah.','List translation engines'=>'Liis garee matoorrada turjumaadda','Lists the translation engines, whether each is set up, and which one is used when none is named.'=>'Waxay taxaysaa aaladaha turjumaadda, haddii mid kasta la habeeyay, iyo midka la isticmaalo marka aan midna la magacobin.','Translate a post or page'=>'Turjun qoraal ama bog','Translates one post or page into one or more of the site\'s languages with a translation engine, creating each translation or updating it. New translations are drafts unless publish is true. A translation a person edited is skipped unless force is true.'=>'Waxay ku turjumaysaa hal qoraal ama bog hal ama in ka badan oo ka mid ah luqadaha goobta iyadoo adeegsanaysa mishiinka turjumaada, iyadoo abuuraysa turjumaad kasta ama cusboonaysiinaysa. Turjumaadaha cusubi waa qabyo ilaa publish ay tahay run (true). Turjumaada qof wax ka beddelay waa la kaalmayaa ilaa force ay tahay run (true).','Codes of languages set up on this site, e.g. de_DE, or just de when only one German is listed.'=>'Xeerarka luqadaha lagu habeeyay boggan, tusaale ahaan de_DE, ama kaliya de marka hal Jarmal kaliya la qoro.','The id of a translation engine set up on this site; the default engine when omitted.'=>'Aqoonsiga mashiinka turjumaada ee lagu habeeyay boggan; mashiinka caadiga ah marka laga tago.','Translation status'=>'Xaaladda turjumaadda','With a post ID: each language\'s translation of that post, whether it is out of date, and who wrote it. Without one: how much of the site is translated, per language.'=>'Haddii uu leeyahay ID-ga qoraalka: turjumaadda qoraalkaas ee luuqad kasta, haddii ay dhacday, iyo cidda qortay. Haddii aanu lahayn: inta laga turjumay bogga, luuqad kasta.','Translate my site'=>'Turjum boggayga','A guided workflow: the agent checks the languages and engine, estimates the cost, and translates what is missing, asking before it spends or publishes.'=>'Hannaan shaqo oo la hago: wakiilku wuxuu hubiyaa luuqadaha iyo mashiinka, wuxuu qiyaasaa kharashka, wuxuuna turjumaa waxa dhiman, isagoo wax weydiinaya ka hor inta uusan kharash gareyn ama daabicin.','The languages to translate into, e.g. German and French.'=>'Luuqadaha loo turjumayo, tusaale ahaan Jarmal iyo Faransiis.','Translate this WordPress site into: %s. Steps: 1) call tranzly-list-languages; if a language is missing, ask me before adding it with tranzly-update-settings; 2) call tranzly-list-engines and make sure one is set up (otherwise tell me which key to add); 3) call tranzly-translation-status for the whole site and tranzly-estimate for what is missing, and tell me the cost before spending anything; 4) after I agree, translate with tranzly-bulk-translate if it is available (Pro), otherwise post by post with tranzly-translate-post; 5) new translations stay drafts unless I say to publish; 6) finish with tranzly-translation-status and list what is still missing.'=>'U turjun boggan WordPress: %s. Tallaabooyinka: 1) wac tranzly-list-languages; haddii luqad maqan tahay, i weydii ka hor inta aadan ku darin tranzly-update-settings; 2) wac tranzly-list-engines oo xaqiiji in mid la habeeyay (haddii kale ii sheeg fureha la gelinayo); 3) wac tranzly-translation-status bogga oo dhan iyo tranzly-estimate wixii maqan, iina sheeg kharashka ka hor inta aan waxba la bixin; 4) ka dib markaan ogolaado, ku turjun tranzly-bulk-translate haddii la heli karo (Pro), haddii kale maqaal maqaal u raac adigoo isticmaalaya tranzly-translate-post; 5) turjumaadaha cusubi waxay ahaanayaan qabyo ilaa aan dhaho daabac; 6) ku dhammee tranzly-translation-status oo tax wixii weli maqan.','Name at least one language.'=>'Sheeg ugu yaraan hal luqad.','Read comment handling (Pro)'=>'Akhri maaraynta faallooyinka (Pro)','Returns whether comments are shared across languages or kept per language.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa haddii faallooyinka la wadaago luqadaha oo dhan ama lagu hayo luqad kasta goonideeda.','Change comment handling (Pro)'=>'Beddel maaraynta faallooyinka (Pro)','Shares comments across a post\'s translations or keeps them per language (mode).'=>'Faallooyinka waxa lagu wadaagaa dhammaan turjumada qoraalka ama waxa loo hayaa luuqad kasta gaarkeeda (hab).','Read the display options'=>'Akhri xulashooyinka bandhigga','Returns the language switcher and credit display options.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa badelaha luqadda iyo dookhyada muujinta xuquuqda.','Change the display options'=>'Beddel xulashooyinka bandhigga','Changes the switcher (style, flags, names, placement) and the credit line.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa beddelaha (qaabka, calanka, magacyada, meelaynta) iyo khadka ammaanta.','Read the DeepL usage'=>'Akhriso isticmaalka DeepL','Returns the characters used and the limit of the saved DeepL key this month.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa xuruufta la isticmaalay iyo xadka furaha DeepL ee la keydiyay bishan.','Read the engine settings'=>'Akhri habaynta mishiinka','Returns the default and fallback engine, per-language engines and AI models, each engine\'s state, the connected AI providers with their models, and this month\'s spend.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa mashiinka caadiga ah iyo kan keydka ah, mashiinnada luqad kasta iyo moodallada AI, xaaladda mashiin kasta, bixiyeyaasha AI ee ku xiran oo ay la socdaan moodalladooda, iyo kharashka bishan.','Change the engine settings'=>'Beddel habaynta mishiinka','Sets the default engine, a fallback engine, per-language engines and per-language AI models (default, fallback, per_lang, models, caps). Everything but the default engine is Pro.'=>'Waxay dejisaa mashiinka caadiga ah, mashiinka beddelka ah, mashiinnada luqad kasta, iyo moodallada AI ee luqad kasta (default, fallback, per_lang, models, caps). Wax kasta oo aan ahayn mashiinka caadiga ah waa Pro.','ID of the default translation engine (deepl, ai, google or microsoft); empty for automatic.'=>'Aqoonsiga (ID) mashiinka turjumaada caadiga ah (deepl, ai, google ama microsoft); bannaan uga tag si uu si toos ah ugu shaqeeyo.','Pro: language code => engine ID used for that language.'=>'Pro: koodhka luuqadda => aqoonsiga mashiinka (engine ID) loo adeegsaday luuqaddaas.','Pro: engine IDs tried in order when the first one fails.'=>'Pro: Aqoonsiyada mashiinka waxaa loo tijaabiyaa si isdaba-joog ah marka kan ugu horreeya uu fashilmo.','Pro: engine ID => monthly spending cap in US dollars. An AI provider has its own cap, keyed ai: and the provider id, for example ai:anthropic.'=>'Pro: ID-ga mashiinka => xadka kharashka bishii ee doolarka US. Bixiyaha AI wuxuu leeyahay xad u gaar ah, oo fure looga dhigay ai: iyo id-ga bixiyaha, tusaale ahaan ai:anthropic.','Pro: language code => {provider, model} used when the AI engine translates that language; the key * sets the model for every other language. Empty model: the provider\'s recommended one.'=>'Pro: koodka luqadda => {provider, model} la isticmaalo marka mishiinka AI uu turjumayo luqaddaas; furaha * wuxuu u dejiyaa moodeelka luqad kasta oo kale. Moodeel madhan: midka uu bixiyuhu ku taliyay.','Save an engine key'=>'Kaydi furaha mishiinka','Saves the API key (and region for Microsoft) of DeepL, Google or Microsoft; empty removes it. Keys are stored encrypted and never returned.'=>'Waxay keydisaa furaha API (iyo gobolka Microsoft) ee DeepL, Google ama Microsoft; marka la faaruqiyo waa laga saarayaa. Furayaasha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa iyagoo sir ah lamana soo celiyo weligood.','Estimate a translation'=>'Qiyaas turjumid','Estimates characters and cost to translate posts (posts or post_type) into languages (langs) with an engine, before spending anything.'=>'Waxay qiyaastaa xuruufta iyo kharashka lagu turjumayo qoraallada (posts ama post_type) luuqadaha (langs) iyadoo la adeegsanayo mishiin, ka hor inta aan waxba la bixin.','Import a translated file (Pro)'=>'Soo geli fayl la tarjumay (Pro)','Uploads a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file (content, filename) translated elsewhere; answers a token that identifies the upload for the import.'=>'Wuxuu soo geliyaa faylka Tranzly XLIFF ama CSV (nuxurka, magaca faylka) oo meel kale lagu turjumay; wuxuu soo celiyaa calaamad (token) lagu garto soo-gelinta si loo soo dhoofsado.','The XLIFF or CSV file\'s text.'=>'Qoraalka faylka XLIFF ama CSV.','The file name, e.g. site-de.xlf.'=>'Magaca faylka, tusaale ahaan site-de.xlf.','List plugins to migrate from (Pro)'=>'Liis garee plugins-ka laga guurayo (Pro)','Lists WPML, Polylang and TranslatePress data found on this site that can be imported.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa xogta WPML, Polylang iyo TranslatePress ee laga helay goobtan kuwaas oo la soo dhoofsan karo.','Migrate from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress (Pro)'=>'Ka soo guuri WPML, Polylang ama TranslatePress (Pro)','Imports the next page of translations from another multilingual plugin (mode: dry-run or run; cursor).'=>'Waxay ka soo dejisaa bogga xiga ee turjumada plug-in kale oo luuqado badan leh (habka: dry-run ama run; cursor).','Write an imported file (Pro)'=>'Qor fayl la soo dejiyay (Pro)','Writes the next page of posts from an uploaded translation file (repeat with after until done).'=>'Waxay qortaa bogga xiga ee qoraallada laga soo qaaday faylka tarjumaadda ee la soo geliyay (ku celi after ilaa la dhammeeyo).','Read the integrations'=>'Akhri is-dhexgalka','Lists the SEO, WooCommerce, page-builder and form plugins Tranzly supports and which are active here.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa SEO-ga, WooCommerce, dhisaha bogga iyo furayaasha foomka ee Tranzly taageero oo halkan ka shaqeynaya.','List translation jobs'=>'Liis garee howlaha turjumaadda','Lists background translation jobs, newest first, with progress.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa shaqooyinka turjumaada gadaal ka socda, kuwa ugu cusub marka hore, oo ay la socoto horumarka.','Start a translation job'=>'Bilow hawl turjumid','Starts a background job translating listed posts (posts) or a whole post type into languages (langs).'=>'Wuxuu bilaabayaa hawl xagga dambe ka socota oo qoraallada liiska ku jira (posts) ama nooc qoraal oo dhan u turjumaysa luuqadaha (langs).','Retry or hand off a failed item'=>'Isku day mar kale ama wareeji shey fashilmay','Retries a failed item (action: retry, optionally with another engine) or marks it for translating by hand (action: by-hand).'=>'Waxay dib u tijaabisaa shaygu fashilmay (ficil: retry, si ikhtiyaari ah mishiin kale leh) ama waxay u calaamadisaa turjumaad gacanta ah (ficil: by-hand).','Read a job\'s progress'=>'Akhri horumarka shaqada','Returns one job\'s progress and counts.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa horumarka iyo tirada hal shaqo.','Cancel a job'=>'Jooji shaqo','Stops a job; translations already made are kept.'=>'Wuxuu joojiyaa shaqo; tarjumadii hore loo sameeyay waa la hayaa.','Read a job\'s failures'=>'Akhriso guuldarrooyinka shaqada','Lists a job\'s failed items with the reason for each.'=>'Waxay liis garaysaa shayada shaqada ee fashilmay iyadoo ay la socoto sababta mid kasta.','Read the licence'=>'Akhriso shatiga','Returns this site\'s Tranzly plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa qorshaha Tranzly ee boggan, xaaladda shatiga, taariikhda cusboonaysiinta, iyo waxa uu qorshuhu ka kooban yahay.','Disconnect from support'=>'Ka go\' taageerada','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Waxay gooysaa xiriirka goobtan ee taageerada.','Read the support connection'=>'Akhri xidhiidhka taageerada','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Waxay sheegaysaa haddii goobtan ay ku xiran tahay taageerada Zinn Digital®, iyo qofka ahaan.','Connect to support'=>'Ku xir taageerada','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Waxay goobtan ku xireysaa taageerada Zinn Digital® (magaca, iimaylka, oggolaanshaha).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Oggolow ogaanshaha cilladaha ee caawinta','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Waxay diiwaangelisaa oggolaanshaha maamulaha ee dirista xogta baaritaanka ee la socota tikidhada taageerada.','True records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'True waxay diiwaangelisaa oggolaanshaha maamulaha ee dirista xogta baaritaanka ee la socota codsiyada caawinta.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Akhri baaritaanka goobta','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa xogta baaritaanka ee tigidhka taageeradu qaadi lahaa: noocyada, plugin-yada shaqaynaya, xadadka iyo khaladaadkii ugu dambeeyay.','Open a support ticket'=>'Fur tigidhka taageerada','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'Waxay gudbisaa tigidhka taageerada (mawduuca, fariinta, nooca, iimaylka), oo ay la socdaan xogta baaritaanka goobtan markii maamuluhu oggolaaday. Weligeed ma abuurto galitaan lamana diro.','The ticket subject (up to 200 characters).'=>'Mowduuca tigidhka (ilaa 200 xaraf).','What happened, or the question.'=>'Wixii dhacay, ama su\'aasha.','The kind of request; help when omitted.'=>'Nooca codsiga; caawin marka laga tago.','Reply address; the connected support email when omitted.'=>'Cinwaanka jawaabta; iimaylka taageerada ee ku xiran marka laga tago.','Name to reply to.'=>'Magaca loogu jawaabayo.','True attaches this site\'s diagnostics (needs the administrator\'s consent).'=>'True wuxuu ku lifaaqaa baaritaannada goobtan (waxay u baahan tahay oggolaanshaha maamulaha).','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Bilow tijaabada bilaashka ah ee Pro','Starts the 14-day Tranzly Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Waxay bilaabaysaa tijaabada 14-maalmood ee Tranzly Pro ee goobtan (wax lacag-bixin ah looma baahna).','Read the Tranzly 2.x import'=>'Akhri soo dejinta Tranzly 2.x','Returns the state and report of importing translations from Tranzly 2.x.'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa xaaladda iyo warbixinta soo dejinta tarjumaadaha laga keenay Tranzly 2.x.','Import Tranzly 2.x translations'=>'Soo geli tarjumaadaha Tranzly 2.x','Runs the 2.x import: dry-run (report only), run, or undo.'=>'Wuxuu fuliyaa soo dejinta 2.x: tijaabo (warbixin kaliya), fulin, ama ka noqosho.','Translate an image\'s text'=>'Turjun qoraalka sawirka','Saves an image\'s alt text, title or caption (field) in a language (lang).'=>'Waxay ku kaydisaa qoraalka beddelka ah (alt text), ciwaanka ama qoraal-koobeedka (caption) sawirka (field) luuqad (lang).','Read the menus per language'=>'Akhri liisaska luqad kasta','Returns which menu each language shows in each menu location.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa liiska luuqad kasta ay ku muujiso goob kasta oo liiska ah.','Set the menus per language'=>'U deji liiska luqad kasta','Assigns a menu per language per location (map).'=>'Waxay ku meelaysaa menu luuqad kasta goob kasta (khariidad).','Protect or unlock a translation'=>'Iilaali ama fur turjumaad','Protects a translation from being overwritten by the engine (protected: true), or unlocks it.'=>'Waxay ka ilaalisaa tarjumaadda in matoorku tirtiro oo dul qoro (protected: true), ama furaysaa.','Read a quality report (Pro)'=>'Akhri warbixinta tayada (Pro)','Returns a translation\'s AI quality report: score and the segments it flagged.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa warbixinta tayada AI ee turjumaadda: dhibcaha iyo qaybaha la calaamadeeyay.','Approve or reject a translation (Pro)'=>'Oggolow ama diid tarjumaad (Pro)','Approves a translation (and publishes it when the original is published) or sends it back (decision, note).'=>'Wuxuu ansixiyaa turjumaad (oo wuxuu daabacaa marka asalka la daabaco) ama dib ayuu u soo celiyaa (go\'aan, qoraal).','Read a translation side by side'=>'U akhri turjumaadda dhinac-ka-dhinac','Returns a translation\'s segments beside the original\'s, for review and correction.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa qaybaha tarjumaadda oo barbar yaalla kuwa asalka ah, si dib loogu eego loona saxo.','Correct a translation'=>'Sax tarjumaad','Saves corrected segments of a translation (segments: key to text); corrected text is protected from re-translation.'=>'Wuxuu keydiyaa qeybaha la saxay ee turjumaadda (qeybaha: fure u ah qoraalka); qoraalka la saxay waxaa laga ilaaliyaa in dib loo turjumo.','Unlink a post from its translations'=>'Ka saar qoraalka xiriirinta qoraalladiisa la turjumay','Takes a post out of its translation group; it keeps its language.'=>'Qoraal ka saaraya kooxda turjumaada; waxay haysanaysaa luqaddeeda.','Read a post\'s translations'=>'Akhri tarjumaadaha qoraalka','Lists a post\'s translation group: every language\'s member with its title, status and edit link.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa kooxda tarjumaadda qoraalka: xubin kasta oo luqadeed oo wadata cinwaankeeda, xaaladdeeda iyo xiriirinta wax ka beddelka.','Create an empty translation'=>'Samee turjumaad maran','Creates a draft translation of a post in a language (lang) to write by hand, without an engine.'=>'Waxay abuureysaa qabyo-qoraal turjumidda qoraal oo ku qoran luqad (lang) si gacanta loogu qoro, iyadoo aan mashiin la adeegsan.','Link an existing post as a translation'=>'Ku xidh qoraal jira sidii turjumaad','Makes an existing post (target) the translation of this post in a language.'=>'Qoraal jira (bartilmaameed) ka dhigaya tarjumaadda qoraalkan ee luuqad ku qoran.','Check translations with AI (Pro)'=>'Ku hubi tarjumaadaha AI (Pro)','Schedules the AI quality check of the next page of a language\'s translations (or the given posts).'=>'Wuxuu jadwal u sameeyaa hubinta tayada AI ee bogga xiga ee tarjumada luuqadda (ama qoraallada la bixiyay).','Multilingual SEO audit (Pro)'=>'Hanti-dhowrka SEO ee luuqadaha badan (Pro)','Checks translations for missing SEO titles, descriptions, slugs and hreflang in a language, page by page.'=>'Waxay turjumada ka hubisaa cinwaannada SEO, sharraxaadaha, slugs-ka iyo hreflang ee ka maqan luuqad, bog bog.','Change languages and settings'=>'Beddel luqadaha iyo habaynta','Sets the site\'s languages (languages: list of code and name; the first is the original language), the front-end class prefix, and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Waxay dejisaa luqadaha goobta (luqadaha: liiska koodka iyo magaca; kan hore waa luqadda asalka ah), horgalaha fasalka qaybta hore (front-end), iyo haddii wakiilada AI (MCP) la oggol yahay.','Read theme and plugin texts'=>'Akhri qoraallada dulucda iyo fur-halka','Returns the theme and plugin texts (scope) in a language with their translations.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa qoraallada dulucda iyo fur-hayeha (baaxadda) ee luqad ku qoran oo ay la socdaan turjumaadahooda.','Translate missing theme and plugin texts'=>'Turjun qoraallada maqan ee theme-ka iyo plugin-ka','Translates the next page of untranslated theme and plugin texts in a language with the default engine (repeat with after until done).'=>'Waxay ku tarjumaysaa bogga xiga ee qoraallada aan la tarjumin ee theme-ka iyo plugin-ka luuqad adoo adeegsanaya mishiinka caadiga ah (ku celi after ilaa laga dhammeeyo).','Correct theme and plugin texts'=>'Sax qoraalada dulucda iyo fur-hilibka','Saves corrected translations of theme and plugin texts (strings); they become protected.'=>'Waxay kaydisaa tarjumaadaha la saxay ee qoraallada (xadhkaha) mawduuca iyo fur-hilibka; waxay noqdaan kuwo la ilaaliyo.','Translate what is missing'=>'Turjun waxa maqan','Queues translation of every missing (or out-of-date) item in a language and post type.'=>'Saf gelinaya tarjumaadda shay kasta oo maqan (ama dhacay) ee luuqad iyo nooc qoraal ah.','List what is missing or out of date'=>'Qor waxa maqan ama dhacay','Lists originals with their translation state in a language (state: missing, stale, current), page by page.'=>'Wuxuu bog-bog u taxayaa qoraallada asalka ah oo ay la socoto heerka tarjumaddooda ee luuqad (heerka: maqan, dhacay, hadda).','Read the site\'s texts in a language'=>'Ku akhri qoraallada goobta luuqad','Returns the site title, tagline and widget texts in a language.'=>'Waxay ku soo celisaa cinwaanka goobta, hal-ku-dhigga iyo qoraallada widget-ka hal luuqad.','Translate a site text'=>'Turjun qoraalka goobta','Saves one site text (key) in a language, e.g. the site title or tagline.'=>'Waxay ku kaydisaa qoraal goobeed keliya (fure) hal luuqad, tusaale ahaan cinwaanka goobta ama hal-ku-dhegga.','Translate a category or tag'=>'Turjun qayb ama calaamad','Translates one term (category, tag or product attribute) into a language (lang) with an engine, creating or updating its translation.'=>'Wuxuu eray keliya (qayb, sumad ama sifo badeecadeed) u turjumayaa luuqad (lang) isaga oo adeegsanaya makiinad, isaga oo abuuraya ama cusboonaysiinaya turjumadiisa.','Unlink a term from its translations'=>'Ka saar xiriirka ereyga iyo turjumadiisa','Takes a term out of its translation group.'=>'Ereyga wuxuu ka saarayaa kooxda turjumidiisa.','Read a term\'s translations'=>'Akhri tarjumaadaha ereyga','Lists a category\'s or tag\'s translation group.'=>'Liiska kooxda tarjumaadda qaybta ama calaamadda.','Create a term translation by hand'=>'Ku samee turjumaada ereyga gacanta','Creates a term\'s translation in a language with a name, slug and description you give.'=>'Waxay ku abuurtaa tarjumaadda erey luuqad leh magac, slug iyo sharraxaad aad bixiso.','Link an existing term as a translation'=>'Ku xir eray jira turjumaad ahaan','Makes an existing term (target) the translation of this term in a language.'=>'Waxay erey jira (bartilmaameed) ka dhigaysaa tarjumaadda ereygan ee luuqad.','List theme and plugin text sources (Pro)'=>'Liis garee ilaha qoraalka mawduuca iyo fur-hawaalaha (Pro)','Lists the themes and plugins whose texts can be scanned for translation, and how many strings each has.'=>'Wuxuu taxaa mawduucyada iyo furayaasha qoraalladooda la baari karo si loo turjumo, iyo inta xadhig ee mid kasta leeyahay.','Scan a theme or plugin for texts (Pro)'=>'U baadh mawduuc ama furin qoraallo (Pro)','Scans the next page of a component\'s PHP files for translatable texts (repeat with after until done).'=>'Waxay baartaa bogga xiga ee faylasha PHP ee qayb ka mid ah qoraallada la turjumi karo (ku celi after ilaa laga dhammeeyo).','Read the address settings'=>'Akhri habaynta ciwaanka','Returns how languages appear in addresses (folder, subdomain or domain), translated slugs and bases, and noindex for untranslated pages.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa sida luuqaduhu ugu muuqdaan cinwaanada (gal, qayb-domain ama domain), hal-ku-dhigyada la turjumay iyo aasaaska, iyo noindex ee bogagga aan la turjumin.','Change the address settings'=>'Beddel habaynta cinwaanka','Sets the address mode (mode), per-language domains, translated bases and segments, noindex_untranslated and slug suggestions.'=>'Waxay dejisaa habka ciwaanka (mode), xayndaabyada luuqad kasta, saldhigyada iyo qaybaha la turjumay, noindex_untranslated iyo talooyinka slug.','Estimate translating the site (Pro)'=>'Qiyaas turjumaadda bogga (Pro)','Estimates a whole-site translation in a language (post_types, scope, engine) before starting it.'=>'Waxay qiyaasaysaa turjumaadda goobta oo dhan ee luuqad (post_types, scope, engine) ka hor inta aan la bilaabin.','Read the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Akhri habaynta habsami-u-socodka shaqada (Pro)','Returns auto-translation on publish and on update, review before publish, and the AI quality check\'s threshold, provider and model.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa turjumaadda tooska ah marka la daabaco iyo marka la cusboonaysiiyo, dib-u-eegista ka hor daabacaadda, iyo xadka, bixiyaha iyo nooca hubinta tayada AI.','Change the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Beddel habaynta socodka shaqada (Pro)','Sets on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider and quality_model.'=>'Waxay dejisaa on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider iyo quality_model.','When an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Marka asalka wax iska beddelaan: waxba ha samayn, ku calaamadee tarjumadiisa kuwo dhacay, ama mar kale tarjun.','Translate a post into every language when it is published.'=>'U turjun qoraal luuqad kasta marka la daabaco.','New translations wait for review instead of being published.'=>'Turjumaadaha cusub waxay sugayaan dib-u-eegis halkii la daabici lahaa.','Quality score below which a translation is flagged.'=>'Dhibcaha tayada ee haddii laga hooseeyo turjumaadda la calamadeeyo.','AI provider of the quality check.'=>'Bixiyaha AI ee hubinta tayada.','AI model of the quality check.'=>'Qaabka AI ee hubinta tayada.','Translate the whole site'=>'Turjun dhammaan goobta','Starts background translation jobs for every original of the given content types (all translated types when none are given): the missing translations, the out-of-date ones, or all of them. Returns the jobs started, one per language.'=>'Wuxuu bilaabayaa shaqooyinka tarjumaadda asalka ah ee nooc kasta oo asalka ah ee noocyada nuxurka la bixiyay (dhammaan noocyada la tarjumay marka aan midna la bixin): tarjumaadaha maqan, kuwa duugoobay, ama dhammaantood. Wuxuu soo celinayaa shaqooyinka bilaabmay, midkiiba luqad kasta.','Check a translation with AI'=>'Ku hubi turjumaad AI','Has AI compare one translation with its original and score it, and stores the report on the translation. Uses the quality-check AI model set in Tranzly\'s workflow settings.'=>'Waxay AI u dirtaa inay hal turjumid la barbar dhigto asalkeedii oo ay bureyso, waxayna warbixinta ku kaydisaa turjumidda. Waxay isticmaashaa qaabka AI ee hubinta tayada ee lagu dejiyay habaynta shaqada ee Tranzly.','The translation\'s post ID.'=>'Aqoonsiga qoraalka turjumaadda.','Export a file for human translators'=>'U dhoofi fayl turjumayaasha aadanaha ah','Returns an XLIFF or CSV file (as text) with the originals and their translations in one language, for a translator or a translation agency: the given posts, or a page of up to 100 originals of a content type in a state (missing, stale, translated or all; repeat with after). The same file can be imported back once translated.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa fayl XLIFF ama CSV ah (qoraal ahaan) oo wata asalka iyo turjumaadooda oo hal luuqad ah, looguna talagalay turjumaan ama hay\'ad turjumaad: qoraallada la bixiyay, ama bog ka kooban ilaa 100 asal ah oo nooc nuxur ah oo ku jira xaalad (missing, stale, translated ama all; ku celi after). Faylkaas la midka ah dib ayaa loo soo gelin karaa marka la turjumo.','Words never translated (brand and product names).'=>'Erayada aan waligood la tarjumin (magacyada sumadda iyo alaabta).','Per language code: source term => the translation always used.'=>'Koodka luuqad kasta: ereyga asalka ah => turjumaadda mar walba la isticmaalo.','Per language code: formality (default, more, less) and style instructions.'=>'Halka koodhka luuqadda: maamuuska (asalka, ka badan, ka yar) iyo tilmaamaha habka qoraalka.','Read the glossary'=>'Akhri qaamuuska','Returns the words never translated, the fixed term translations and the tone per language.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa ereyada aan waligood la turjumin, turjumaadaha ereyada go\'an iyo codka luuqad kasta.','Update the glossary'=>'Cusbooneysii qaamuuska ereyada','Replaces the parts of the glossary you send (words never translated, term translations, tone); parts you leave out are kept. Used by every engine from the next translation on.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa qaybaha qaamuuska ee aad soo dirto (ereyada aan marnaba la turjumin, turjumaadaha ereyada, codka); qaybaha aad ka tagto waa la hayaa. Waxaa isticmaala mishiin kasta laga bilaabo turjumaadda xigta.','Language suggestion'=>'Soo jeedinta luqadda','This page is also available in %s.'=>'Boggan waxa kale oo lagu heli karaa %s.','Read it in %s'=>'Ku akhri %s','No thanks'=>'Maya, mahadsanid','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'Dooro sida luuqaduhu ugu soo muuqanayaan cinwaanadaada: gal, qayb-domain, domain gooni ah ama halbeeg weydiin.','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Qayb-hoosaadyada iyo bogagga gaarka ah ee luuqad kasta waa qayb ka mid ah Tranzly Pro.','The language folders must be a list.'=>'Faylasha luuqaddu waa inay noqdaan liis.','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'"%s" ma noqon karo gal luqadeed. Isticmaal 2 ilaa 12 xaraf oo yaryar, tirooyin ama calaamadaha hyphen-ka, oo u gaar ah luqad kasta, oo aan ahayn eray uu WordPress hore u isticmaalay.','The domains must be a list.'=>'Domain-yadu waa inay liis noqdaan.','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'"%s" ma aha magac domain, sida example.de.','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'Luuqad kasta waxay u baahan tahay bogeeda gaarka ah.','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'Erayada ciwaanka ee la tarjumay waa inay noqdaan liis.','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'Erayada ciwaanka ee la tarjumay waa in lagu qoraa luuqad kasta gaarkeeda.','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s" laguma isticmaali karo ciwaan. Isticmaal xarfo yaryar, lambarro iyo calaamadaha hyphen-ka.','This setting is on or off.'=>'Habsocodkani wuu daaran yahay ama wuu dansan yahay.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Qarinta bogagga aan la turjumin ee matoorada raadinta waa qayb ka mid ah Tranzly Pro.','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'Luqadaha','Languages (side by side)'=>'Luqadaha (dhinac-ka-dhinac)','Add to Menu'=>'Ku dar Liiska','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'Boggaaga, shaygani wuxuu muujinayaa luuqadaha bogga, mid kastaana wuxuu ku xirayaa bogga hadda jira ee luuqadaas.','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'Xiriirinta boggan ee luuqad kasta oo aad ku hadasho.','Language name'=>'Magaca luqadda','Language code'=>'Koodhka luqadda','Name and code'=>'Magaca iyo koodhka','Design'=>'Naqshad','Show each language as'=>'U muuji luqad kasta sida','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'Muuji calammada (calanku waa dal, ma aha luqad)','List'=>'Liis','Pills'=>'Kiniinno','Buttons'=>'Batoonada','Dropdown'=>'Liiska hoos-u-dhaca','Language codes'=>'Koodadka luqadda','Flags'=>'Calaamooyinka','Include the current language'=>'Ku dar luuqadda hadda jirta','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Qari luuqadaha aan boggan loo turtermin','Stack vertically'=>'Isku kor dhis toosan','Accessible label'=>'Sumad la heli karo','Text'=>'Qoraal','Background'=>'Gadaal','Current language text'=>'Qoraalka luqadda hadda','Current language background'=>'Asalka luuqadda hadda','Border'=>'Xuduud','Corner radius'=>'Gacanka geeska','Space between languages'=>'Masaafada u dhaxaysa luqadaha','Text size'=>'Cabirka qoraalka','Switcher'=>'Beddele','(no title)'=>'(cinwaan ma leh)','There is nothing to fix here.'=>'Halkan wax la hagaajiyo ma jiraan.','No content type is translated on this site.'=>'Ma jiro nooc nuxur ah oo lagu turjumay bogaan.','That content type is not translated on this site.'=>'Noocaas nuxurka ah laguma turjumin boggan.','There is nothing to translate in that selection.'=>'Ma jiraan wax lagu turjumo doorashadaas.','Choose at least one language to translate into.'=>'Dooro ugu yaraan hal luqad oo loo turjumo.','You are not allowed to export translations.'=>'Loma oggola inaad dhoofiso tarjumaadaha.','Choose an XLIFF or CSV file to import.'=>'Dooro fayl XLIFF ama CSV ah si aad u soo geliso.','That is not a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file. Export one first, translate it, and import it here.'=>'Taasi ma ahan faylka Tranzly XLIFF ama CSV. Marka hore mid dhoofi, turjun, ka dibna halkan soo geli.','The file could not be stored for importing. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faylka lama kaydin karin si loo soo dejiyo. Hubi in fayl-galka wax lagu shubo la qori karo.','That import is not there any more. Upload the file again.'=>'Soo dejintaas meesha ma sii taallo. Mar kale soo geli faylka.','That page is not on this site any more.'=>'Boggaas mar dambe kuma jiro boggan.','The file is for a language this site does not have.'=>'Faylku wuxuu u gaar yahay luuqad uusan lahayn boggani.','Could not link %1$s %2$d: %3$s'=>'Lama xiriirin karin %1$s %2$d: %3$s','Post #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Qoraalka #%1$d: %2$s','No data from that plugin was found on this site.'=>'Wax xog ah oo ka timid furahaas lagama helin goobtan.','This is not a translation of anything on this site.'=>'Kani ma aha turjumaad wax ka mid ah boggan.','There is no text to check.'=>'Ma jiro qoraal la hubiyo.','The AI settings are not part of this build.'=>'Dejinta AI qayb kama aha dhismahan.','The AI provider did not answer.'=>'Bixiyaha AI kama jawaabin.','The AI model did not score every part of this page. Try again, or choose another model.'=>'Qaabka AI ma uusan dhibcayn qayb kasta oo ka mid ah boggan. Fadlan isku day mar kale, ama dooro qaab kale.','Translator'=>'Turjumaan','Translation reviewer'=>'Dib-u-eegaha tarjumaadda','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation.'=>'Dib-u-eegaha ayaa codsaday isbeddel lagu sameeyo tarjumaddan.','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation: %s'=>'Dib-u-eegaha ayaa codsaday isbeddelo lagu sameeyo tarjumaddan: %s','This translation is waiting for a reviewer. Publishing it (as a reviewer) approves it.'=>'Turjumaddan waxay sugaysaa dib-u-eede. Daabicideeda (adiga oo ah dib-u-eede) waxay ka dhigan tahay ansixinteeda.','Only a translation can be reviewed.'=>'Turjumaad kaliya ayaa dib loo eegi karaa.','Choose what happens when an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Dooro waxa dhacaya marka asalka wax iska beddelaan: waxba, u calaamadee tarjumadiisa kuwo duugoobay, ama mar kale tarjun.','The quality threshold is a score from 0 to 100.'=>'Xadka tayada waa dhibco u dhexeeya 0 ilaa 100.','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Mar kale ku muuji talooyinka qarsoon Guudmarka','All'=>'Dhammaan','%d selected'=>'%d la doortay' . "\0" . '%d la doortay','Nothing matches.'=>'Waxba isma waafaqsana.','Select all on this page'=>'Dooro dhammaan boggan ku jira','Select'=>'Dooro','Pages'=>'Bogagga','Previous'=>'Hore','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Bogga %1$d ee %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Ku habee %s dhowr daqiiqo gudahood','Start setup'=>'Bilow dejinta','This site'=>'Boggan','Edition'=>'Daabacaad','Sites on this licence'=>'Bogagga ku jira shatigan','Version'=>'Nooca','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Tani waxay u egtahay nuqul tijaabo ah ama mid maxalli ah, markaa ma isticmaaleyso degel ka tirsan shatigaaga.','See what Pro adds'=>'Eeg waxa Pro ku kordhiso','Go to'=>'U tag','Personal'=>'Shakhsi','Business'=>'Ganacsi','Agency'=>'Wakaalad','Any number of sites'=>'Tiro kasta oo goobo ah','Unlimited sites'=>'Goobo aan xadidnayn','%d site'=>'%d bog' . "\0" . '%d degel','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'Tijaabada %s','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Tijaabadaadii way bilaabatay. Dib u soo geli bogga si aad u aragto dhammaan astaamaha Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'Tijaabada lama bilaabi karin.','Feature'=>'Muuqaal','Included'=>'Ku jira','Not included'=>'Kuma jiraan','Your licence'=>'Shatigaaga','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d ee %2$d ayaa la isticmaalayaa','Renews'=>'Wuxuu cusboonaanayaa','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Nuqullada diyaarinta (staging), tijaabada, iyo localhost-ka ee goobtu waa bilaash weligoodna laguma xisaabiyo xadka goobtaada.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Qorshahaaga waxa ku jira taageero mudnaan leh.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Maamul shatigaaga iyo biilashaada','Get more with Pro'=>'Ku hel wax badan Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Bilaaw tijaabo bilaash ah oo %d-maalmood ah, kaar looma baahna' . "\0" . 'Bilow tijaabo bilaash ah oo %d-maalmood ah, kaar looma baahna','See plans and prices'=>'Fiiri qorshayaasha iyo qiimaha','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Miyaad wada isticmaashaa Tranzly iyo Page Builder Sandwich? Xidhmada waxaa ku jira labada plug-in ee Pro oo qiimo jaban ah.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Shatigaagu wuu dhacay. Cusbooneysii si aad u sii wadato helitaanka wararka cusub iyo astaamaha Pro.','Renew now'=>'Cusboonaysii hadda','Compare the plans'=>'Isbarbardhig qorshayaasha','Search features'=>'Raadi astaamaha','Area'=>'Aag','Included in'=>'Ku jira','No feature matches.'=>'Ma jiraan wax astaamo ah oo u dhigma.','Features by plan'=>'Astaamaha qorshaha','Hide'=>'Qari','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Ka hawlgeli shaashadda Plugins-ka','Install it'=>'Ku shub','Overview'=>'Dulmar guud','Setup'=>'Dejinta','Plans and licence'=>'Qorshayaasha iyo shatiga','Add-ons'=>'Ku-darka','Get help'=>'Hel caawimaad','Feedback'=>'Faallo','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Doorashadaada lama keydin karin.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Xaaladda dejinta lama kaydin karin.','Match my computer'=>'U dhig kombuyuutarkayga','Light'=>'Khafiif','Dark'=>'Madow','Colour scheme'=>'Habka midabka','Help'=>'Caawinaad','Guide to this screen'=>'Hagaha shaashaddan','Take the tour'=>'Bilow booqashada','Get help or report a bug'=>'Hel caawimaad ama soo sheeg cilad','Plugin screens'=>'Shaashadaha plugin-ka','That could not be saved.'=>'Taas lama kaydin karin.','Before you contact support'=>'Kahor inta aadan la xiriirin taageerada','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Codsigaga waxaa laga soo dirayaa boggan waxaana loo dirayaa %s, kuwaas oo sameeya furankan. Waxaan direynaa:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'cinwaankaaga emaylka iyo magacaaga, si aan uga jawaabno;','the subject and message you write;'=>'mawduuca iyo fariinta aad qorto;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'aqoonsigaaga shatiga, si macaamiisha wax bixisa ay u helaan mudnaanta;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'haddii aad saxdo oo keliya: faahfaahinta bogga (noocyada WordPress iyo PHP, mawduuca, furayaasha, qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka oo laga saaray furaha sirta ah iyo cinwaannada iimaylka), kuwaas oo aad akhrisan karto ka hor inta aan la dirin;','Privacy policy'=>'Xeerka ilaalinta xogta','I agree, continue'=>'Waan oggolahay, sii wad','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Xiriirka lama hubin karo.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Taasi ma shaqeynin. Mar kale isku day.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® ayaa goysay goobtan.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® mar dambe ma aqoonsana boggan.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Waxaad ka jartay goobtan.','Connect this site to support'=>'Ku xir goobtan adeegga taageerada','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Waa la xiriiray. Jawaabaha waxay aadayaan %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Kuma xirna. Wali waxaad codsi ku diri kartaa cinwaankaaga iimaylka ee hoose; isku xirku wuxuu kaa badbaadinayaa qoristiisa mar kasta.','E-mail address'=>'Cinwaanka iimaylka','Your name (optional)'=>'Magacaaga (ikhtiyaari)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waxa aan oggolahay in goobtan lagu xidho taageerada Zinn Digital®. Waxa ay diraysaa ciwaanka goobtan, noocyada WordPress iyo PHP iyo nooca fur-hagaajiyaha, waxana laga goyn karaa wakhti kasta halkan ama Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Ku xidh','I need help'=>'Waxaan u baahanahay caawin','Report a bug'=>'Soo sheeg cillad','Send feedback'=>'Dir faallo','Request a feature'=>'Codso sifo','The site details could not be read.'=>'Faahfaahinta goobta lama akhrin karo.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Codsigaaga lama diri karin. Isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo gudahood.','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Faallooyin iyo codsiyada astaamaha','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Waa la diray. Tixraacaagu waa %s, jawaabtayaduna waxay ku iman doontaa iimayl.','What is it about?'=>'Maxay ku saabsan tahay?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'U jawaab (i-mayl)','Subject'=>'Mowduuc','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Maxaad samaysay, maxaad filaysay, maxaase beddelkeeda dhacay?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Ku dar faahfaahinta goobta (noocyada, mawduuca, plugins-ka iyo qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka)','See exactly what is sent'=>'U fiirso waxa dhabta ah ee la dirayo','Loading…'=>'Soo dejinaya…','Send'=>'Dir','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Xidh socdaalka','Back'=>'Dib u noqo','Everything in one place'=>'Wax walba hal meel','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Jadwalladani waxay kuu horseedayaan shaashad kasta oo plugin-ka ah: habaynta, dejinta, shatigaaga, caawinaad iyo wax ka badan.','Help on every screen'=>'Caawinaad shaashad kasta','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fur menu-kan si aad u hesho tilmaamaha shaashadda aad ku sugan tahay, booqashadan, ama aad nooga codsato caawimaad.','Light or dark'=>'Khafiif ama madow','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Dooro iftiin, mugdi, ama sida kombuyuutarkaaga oo kale. Dookhaaga waxaa loo xusuustaa adiga oo keliya.','Welcome'=>'Ku soo dhawoow','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Socdaalkan gaaban wuxuu ku tusayaa meesha waxyaabuhu ku yaallaan. Waxaad ka bixi kartaa wakhti kasta adigoo isticmaalaya Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Boggaaga oo kooban','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Halka horumarka habeynta iyo qorshahaaga ayaa halkan lagu muujiyey, oo ay la socoto waxa xiga ee mudan in la sameeyo.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Qorshahaaga, tirada boggagga uu daboolo, iyo haddii koobigan bogga lagu tiriyo xaddidaaddaas.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Isku day Pro ama sare u qaad','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Ku bilow tijaabo bilaash ah kaar la\'aan, cusboonaysii, ama dib u cusboonaysii, dhammaan halkan.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Astaad kasta iyo qorshaha ay ku jirto. Raadi astaad ama muuji hal aag markiiba.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Faahfaahin dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Furayaasha la shaqeeya kan, iyo adeegyada isla kooxdaas. Kaararka aad ku qarisay shaashadaha kale ayaa mar kale halkan lagu muujin karaa.','Connect for faster help'=>'Ku xirnow caawimaad degdeg ah','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Isku xiriddu waa ikhtiyaari. Waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad dirto codsiyada adigoon qorin iimaylkaaga mar kasta, waxaadna goyn kartaa xiriirka mar kasta oo aad rabto.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Weydiiso caawimaad ama soo sheeg cillad','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Sharax waxa dhacay. Adiga ayaa dooranaya haddii aad ku lifaaqayso macluumaadka bogga, waxaadna marka hore si sax ah u arki kartaa waxa ku jira.','Tell us what to build'=>'Noo sheeg waxa la dhisayo','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Soo dir fikrad, codsi ku saabsan shaqo cusub ama faallo kasta. Waxay toos u gaaraysaa kooxda.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Tani waxay qaadataa dhowr daqiiqo waxayna habaynaysaa %s si ay isla markiiba uga shaqeyso goobtan. Wax walba waad beddeli kartaa hadhow.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Waad diyaarsan tahay. Haddii wax u shaqayn waayaan sidii la filayay, hal gujin oo keliya ayaan kuu jirnaa.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Dhammee','Skip setup'=>'Ka bood habaynta','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Waxaa dhisay Neil Lock, Madaxa Fulinta ee Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Nooca %s','Tranzly website'=>'Websaytka Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Websaytka Zinn Digital®','Installing WordPress\'s own words for this language in the background.'=>'Ku rakibaya erayada WordPress u gaarka ah luqaddan gadaasha.','WordPress\'s own words are installed for this language (and %d plugin and theme translations).'=>'Erayada WordPress lafteeda ayaa loo rakibay luuqaddan (iyo %d tarjumaadaha furayaasha iyo mawduucyada).','Plugin and theme words are installed; WordPress.org has no translation of WordPress itself for this language yet.'=>'Erayada furayaasha iyo mawduucyada waa la rakibay; WordPress.org wali ma hayso tarjumaada WordPress lafteeda ee luqaddan.','WordPress.org has no translation of WordPress\'s own words for this language yet.'=>'WordPress.org wali ma hayso tarjumaadda erayada WordPress u gaarka ah ee luqaddan.','This site does not allow installing translations (file changes are switched off), so WordPress\'s own words stay in English for this language.'=>'Boggani ma oggola rakibidda turjumaannada (beddelka faylasha waa la damiyay), markaa ereyada WordPress lafteeda waxay ku sii jirayaan Ingiriis luuqaddan.','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Fiiri qorshayaasha Pro iyo qiimaha','Languages'=>'Luqadaha','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Luuqadda koowaad waa mida uu nuxurkaagu ku qoran yahay. Soo-booqdayaashu waxay ku beddelaan baloogga beddelaha luuqadda.','(default)'=>'(ugu talagal)','Find a language'=>'Hel luqad','Type its name in your language or in its own, then choose it. The code and name below fill in by themselves.'=>'Ku qor magaciisa luqaddaada ama tiisa, dabadeed dooro. Koodhka iyo magaca hoose iyagaa is buuxin doona.','Locale code'=>'Koodhka luqadda/deegaanka','For example fr_FR'=>'Tusaale ahaan fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Magac (ikhtiyaari)','For example Français'=>'Tusaale ahaan Français','Add language'=>'Ku dar luqad','Front-end output'=>'Soo-saarka qaybta hore','Class name prefix'=>'Horgalaha magaca fasalka','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Magac kasta oo class ah oo furuhu ku daabaco boggagaaga wuxuu ku bilaabmaa horgalahan, markaa boggagu ma muujinayaan furaha dhisay. 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yaryar ama lambar, oo ku bilaabmaya xaraf.','Beta updates'=>'Cusboonaysiinta beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Boggani wuxuu u helaa noocyada tijaabada ah (beta) ahaan casriyeyn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Boggan wuxuu qaabilayaa oo keliya noocyada xasilloon.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Tan ku beddel bogga Koontada','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Noocyada Beta-da waxaa loo fidiyaa rakibaadaha shatiga leh ee Pro ee ku xiran koontadooda. Marka la xiro, waxaad kaga biiri kartaa bogga Koontada.','Save settings'=>'Kaydi habaynta','First engine that is set up'=>'Mashiinkii koowaad ee la habeeyo','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'Furaha waa la keydiyay. Waxaa loo keydiyay si qarsoodi ah dib dambena looma muujin doono.','Engine settings saved.'=>'Habsocodka mishiinka waa la kaydiyay.','Glossary saved.'=>'Qaamuuska waa la keydiyay.','Your keys'=>'Furayaashaada','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly waxay adeegyada tarjumaadda ugu wacdaa koontadaada gaarka ah. Furayaasha waxa lagu kaydiyaa iyaga oo qarsoon xog-ururintaada waxaana loo diraa oo keliya adeegga ay khuseeyaan. Furayaasha nooca AI waxa lagu dejiyaa habaynta AI.','%s API key'=>'Furaha API ee %s','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'Waa la keydiyay: %s. Geli fure cusub si aad ugu beddesho, ama keydi meel bannaan si aad meesha uga saarto.','No key saved.'=>'Furaha lama keydin.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Gobolka Azure (u dhaaf maran kheyraad caalami ah)','Save key'=>'Kaydi furaha','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Hubi isticmaalkayga DeepL','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'%1$s ka mid ah xarfaha %2$s ayaa la isticmaalay muddadan qaansheegta.','Which engine translates'=>'Mashiinkee turjuma','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Weli ma jiro wax matoor ah oo la habeeyay. Keydi furaha kor ku xusan (ama samee nooca AI) si aad u bilowdo turjumaadda.','Default engine'=>'Mashiinka caadiga ah','A different engine or AI model per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Matoor ama nooc AI oo kala duwan luuqad kasta, beddel otomaatig ah iyo xaddidaadaha kharashka bishii waa astaamaha Tranzly Pro.','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Eray-bixinta iyo ereyada aan marnaba la tarjumin','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Waligaa ha tarjumin ereyadan (midkiiba xariiq)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Magacyada astaanta iyo badeecaddu waxay u sugnaanayaan sida ay yihiin, mishiin kasta.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Turjumaadaha la doorbido iyo codka luuqad kasta waa astaamo u gaar ah Tranzly Pro.','Save glossary'=>'Kaydi eraybixinta','Settings'=>'Hagaajinta','Translation engine'=>'Mishiinka tarjumaadda','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Waxa Tranzly ku turjumo goobtan','found, translated with your content'=>'la helay, lagu turjumay nuxurkaaga','not on this site'=>'kuma yaalo goobtan','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Iyadoo la adeegsanayo Tranzly Pro: bogagga Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen iyo WPBakery; wax walba oo ku jira WooCommerce, oo qiimahoodu ku qoran yahay lacagta booqdaha; goobaha SEO ee Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress iyo All in One SEO; goobaha ACF, Meta Box iyo Pods; foomamka iyo iimaylladooda; qoraalka u gaarka ah mawduucaaga iyo furayaashaada (plugins); iyo faallooyinka iyo dib-u-eegisyada.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Qoraalka dukaanka iyo iimayllada','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Mowduucyada iyo ciwaannada iimaylka, magacyada hababka lacag-bixinta iyo raridda, iyo ogeysiisyada bixinta lacagta. Iimayllada dalab kasta waxay ku baxaan luuqaddii lagu dalbaday.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Foomamka iyo iimaylladooda','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Foom kasta wuxuu hayaa hal liis oo gelitaanno ah; summadaha, badhamada, fariimaha iyo iimayllada waxay ku muuqdaan luuqadda booqdaha.','Saved.'=>'Waa la keydiyay.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'Weli lama qeexin wax beeraha ACF, Meta Box ama Pods ah.','Field'=>'Goob','Where'=>'Xaggee','In a translation'=>'Turjumaad dhexdeeda','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Maxaa ku dhaca %s marka la turjumayo','Translate it'=>'Turjun','Copy it as it is'=>'U koobi siduu yahay','Leave it empty'=>'Faaruq uga tag','The shop’s currency'=>'Lacagta dukaanka','Currencies'=>'Lacagaha','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Ku muuji qiimaha lacagaha kale (lacagta dukaanka laftiisa waa %s)','Exchange rates'=>'Heerarka sarifka','Rates last updated %s.'=>'Qiimaha waxa ugu dambayn la cusboonaysiiyay %s.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'Qiimaha weli lama soo qaadin.','Update the rates now'=>'Hadda cusboonaysii qiimayaasha','New currency'=>'Lacag cusub','Choose…'=>'Dooro…','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Qiimaha (halkii 1 %s)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Gelinta qiimaha ayaa ilaalinaysa: cusboonaysiinta maalinlaha ah ma beddeli doonto.','Rounding'=>'Isku-dhafka tirada','None'=>'Midna','Round up'=>'Kordhi ilaa xisaab dhan','Round to the nearest'=>'Ku soo wareeji kan ugu dhow','Round down'=>'Hoos u soo koob','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'Ku soo koob (tusaale ahaan 1, 0.05 ama 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Qiimayaashu waxay ku dhammaadaan (tusaale ahaan 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Ku dar lacag','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Booqdayaasha arka lacagta ay arkaan','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Waddan ahaan: koodhka waddanka oo laba xaraf ah (tusaale ahaan CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'Booqdayaasha ka socda %s','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'U oggolow booqdayaasha inay doortaan (kood gaaban [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Qiimuhu hadda waxay ku xiran yihiin kukiiga ama dalka booqdaha: hubi in khasdanka boggaagu ku kala duwanaado kukiiga "tranzly_currency", ama ka saaro boggaga dukaanka.','Save currencies'=>'Kaydi lacagaha','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Erayada mawduucaaga iyo furayaashaadu (plugins) ay iyagu daabacaan (badhamada, summado). Akhri mawduuca ama furaha hal mar, ka dibna qoraalkiisa halkan ku turjun; turjumaadaadu waxay ka sarreysaa tan furaha laftiisa.','%d texts'=>'%d qoraal','not read yet'=>'wali lama akhrin','Read again'=>'Dib u akhri','Read its text'=>'Akhri qoraalkiisa','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'Shaqadu waxay ku bilaabatay %d turjumaadood oo la qabanayo. Waxay ku socotaa gadaasha: waxaad xiri kartaa boggan.','Queued again.'=>'Mar kale ayaa safka lagu daray.','Running'=>'Socda','Finished'=>'Dhameystiran','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Marka hore ku diyaari matoorka turjumaada tabka Matoorada.','Translate every'=>'Turjun mid kasta','Into'=>'Gudaha','With'=>'La socda','Each language’s own engine'=>'Mishiinka u gaarka ah luqad kasta','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Daabac tarjumada (haddii kale waxaa loo kaydin doonaa sidii qabyo)','Estimate the cost'=>'Qiyaas kharashka','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'%1$d qoraal, %2$s xaraf. Qiimaha mishiinkani hore looma oga.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'%1$d qoraal, %2$s xaraf: qiyaastii $%3$s koontadaada.','Start translating'=>'Bilow turjumidda','Jobs'=>'Shaqooyinka','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan shaqooyin turjumid ah.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Shaqada %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d oo ka mid ah %2$d waa la turjumay, %3$d way fashilmeen, %4$d waa la booday (waa la dhowray ama mar horeba luuqadaas ayay ku qornaayeen)','%1$s: %2$d translated by %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d waxa turjumay %3$s','Stop this job'=>'Jooji shaqadan','See what failed and why'=>'Eeg waxa fashilmay iyo sababta','Content'=>'Xogta','Language'=>'Luqadda','What went wrong'=>'Maxaa khaldamay','Fix it'=>'Hagaaji','Retry with'=>'Ku celi adigoo isticmaalaya','The same engine'=>'Mishiinka la midka ah','Retry'=>'Isku day mar kale','Translate by hand'=>'Ku turjum gacanta','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Waxaa saxay qof, waa la dhowray','Translated by WordPress (language pack), at no cost. Type your own wording to use it instead.'=>'Waxaa si bilaash ah u turjumay WordPress (xirmada luuqadda). Qor ereyadaada si aad taas beddelkeeda ugu isticmaasho.','Menus saved.'=>'Liiska waa la keydiyay.','%d texts translated.'=>'%d qoraal ayaa la tarjumay.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'Waa la keydiyay. Saxitaannadaadu waxay ka badbaadsan yihiin tarjumaadda mashiinka.','The same menu, translated'=>'Liiska la midka ah, la tarjumay','A separate menu per language'=>'Liis gaar ah luqad kasta','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Sida caadiga ah meel kasta oo liiska ka mid ah waa la tarjumaa: xiriiriyeyaashiisu waxay ku geynayaan bogagga la tarjumay, iyagoo wata cinwaannadooda. Taas beddelkeeda halkan uga dooro liis u gaar ah luuqad.','Shared text'=>'Qoraal la wadaagay','Which text'=>'Qoraalkee','Menu labels'=>'Calaamadaha liiska','Site title, tagline and widgets'=>'Cinwaanka goobta, hal-ku-dhegga iyo widget-yada','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Moodallada, madaxyada, cagaha iyo qaababka','Translate the missing text'=>'Turjun qoraalka maqan','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Halkan ma yaallo qoraal la turjumo.','Save corrections'=>'Kaydi saxitaannada','Languages and settings'=>'Luqadaha iyo habaynta','Engines'=>'Matoorada','Translation jobs'=>'Hawlaha turjumaadda','Addresses and SEO'=>'Cinwaannada iyo SEO','Language switchers'=>'Badelayaasha luuqadda','SEO audit'=>'Hantidhawrka SEO','Menus and shared text'=>'Liiska iyo qoraalka la wadaago','Integrations'=>'Isku-xirka','No meta description'=>'Ma jiro sharaxaadda meta','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Nooc luqadeed oo aysan booqdayaashu furi karin (qabyo, gaar ah ama sir-erey leh)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Cinwaanku wali wuxuu isticmaalaa ereyadii asalka ahaa','Still holds the original text'=>'Weli waxa uu wataa qoraalkii asalka ahaa','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Hanti-dhowrka SEO-ga luqadaha badan waa qayb ka mid ah Tranzly Pro. Waxay heshaa sharraxaadaha meta ee maqan, hreflang jabsan, cinwaannada aan la tarjumin iyo waxyaabaha nuqulka ah, luqad kasta.','Language to audit'=>'Luuqadda la baarayo','Run the audit'=>'Orod xisaab-xirka','Check the next pages'=>'Hubi bogagga xiga','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'%1$d bogag ayaa la hubiyay, %2$d dhibaatooyin ah ayaa la helay.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'Luuqadda oo dhan waa la hubiyay.','Page'=>'Bogga','Problem'=>'Dhibaatada','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'Shaqada %1$d way bilaabatay: %2$d bog ayaa gadaasha laga turjumayaa. Kala soco Shaqooyinka turjumaadda.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'%d turjumaadood ayaa gadaal laga hubinayaa. Dhibcuhu halkan ayay ka soo muuqanayaan marka ay yimaadaanba.','Missing'=>'Ma maqna','Out of date'=>'Waqtigiisu dhacay','Translated'=>'La tarjumay','Edited by a person'=>'Waxaa wax ka beddelay qof','Machine translated'=>'Mashiin baa turjumay','Waiting for review'=>'Sugaya dib-u-eegis','Needs a human look'=>'Waxay u baahan tahay eegis bini\'aadan','Everything'=>'Wax walba','Up to date'=>'Casri ah','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly wali wuxuu baarayaa turjumaannada duugga ah ee dhacay. Tirada "dhacay" way kordhayaan inta ay taasi socoto.','Content type'=>'Nooca nuxurka','All content'=>'Dhammaan nuxurka','Average quality'=>'Tayada celcelis ahaan','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'%1$d waa la tarjumay (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Muuji','Translate everything missing'=>'Turjun wax kasta oo maqan','Update everything out of date'=>'Cusboonaysii wax kasta oo dhacay','Check the quality with AI'=>'Ku hubi tayada AI','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Mar kale turjun boggaga dhibcaha hooseeya leh','Nothing here.'=>'Waxba halkan ma yaallaan.','Quality'=>'Tayo','by a person'=>'qof ahaan','waiting for review'=>'Sugaya dib-u-eegis','Show more'=>'Muuji wax dheeraad ah','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Turjun bogga oo dhan mar qura (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Iyadoo la adeegsanayo Tranzly Pro, dooro noocyada nuxurka iyo luuqadaha, arag qiyaasta, oo hal mar wada turjun goobta oo dhan.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'%d hawlood oo xagga dambe ah ayaa bilaabmay, midkiiba luqad kasta. Kala soco Hawlaha turjumaadda dhexdiisa.','Content types'=>'Noocyada nuxurka','What to translate'=>'Waxa la turjumayo','Only what is missing'=>'Kaliya waxa maqan','Only what is out of date'=>'Kaliya waxa dhacay','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Wax walba (boggaga uu qof wax ka beddelay waxay ahaanayaan sidooda)','Estimate'=>'Qiyaas','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'%1$d bogag, %2$s xaraf. Mashiinkani ma daabaco qiimo.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'%1$d bogag, %2$s xuruuf, qiyaastii $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Raadi qoraal','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'%d kale: ku qor "Find a text" si aad liiska u koobto.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Batoon yar oo ku yaal geeska bog kasta, mawduuc kasta, iyada oo aan wax habayn ah loo baahnayn.','Off'=>'Damisan','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Xagasha hoose, dhinaca dambe','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Geeska hoose, dhinaca bilowga','Top corner, end side'=>'Konaalka sare, dhinaca dambe','Top corner, start side'=>'Geeska sare, dhinaca bilowga','Switcher around the content'=>'Beddelaha ku xeeran nuxurka','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Ku dar beddele qoraal iyo bog kasta','Before the content'=>'Kahor nuxurka','After the content'=>'Kaddib nuxurka','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Siyaabo kale oo loogu daro beddelaha','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Tifaftiraha baloogga iyo tifaftiraha bogga: baloogga "Beddelaha luuqadda", oo leh shan naqshadood.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: cunsurka “Beddelaha luuqadda”.','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Liisaska: Muuqalka → Liisaska → sanduuqa “Beddelaha luuqadda”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Dhinacyada: widget-ka "Beddelaha luuqadda".','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Meel kasta oo kale, koodka gaaban:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor iyo Bricks: widhigetka "Beddelaha luuqadda" ee ku jira dhise kasta.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Widget-yada Elementor iyo Bricks waxay qayb ka yihiin Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Kaydi','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Galka luqad kasta: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Qayb-domain luuqad kasta: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Domain gooni u ah luuqad kasta: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Halbeeg su\'aaleed: example.com/?lang=de (boggag hore)','Category'=>'Qeybta','Tag'=>'Sumad','Product'=>'Badeecad','Product category'=>'Qaybta alaabta','Product tag'=>'Sumadda alaabta','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'Waa la keydiyay. Cinwaannada luuqaddaadu waxay isu beddeleen sida hoos ku cad.','Language in the address'=>'Luuqadda cinwaanka ku jirta','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Sida booqdayaasha iyo matoorrada goobiddu u gaadhaan luuqad kasta','Address word for %s'=>'Ereyga cinwaanka ee %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Luuqadda caadiga ah ma laha wax eray ah cinwaannadeeda.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Domain-ka %s (ikhtiyaari)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Marka hore goobta u tilmaan goobtan. Luuqad aan lahayn goob waxay isticmaashaa gal ku yaal goobtaada ugu muhiimsan.','Where each language lives now'=>'Halka luuqad kasta ay hadda ku taal','Translated address words'=>'Erayada ciwaanka ee la tarjumay','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Cinwaannada bogga iyo qoraalka waxay ka yimaadaan cinwaannadooda la tarjumay. Halkan waxaad ku tarjumaysaa erayada go\'an, sidaas darteed /de/kategorie/ waxay beddelaysaa /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (hadda “%2$s”)','Search engines and visitors'=>'Matourada raadinta iyo booqdayaasha','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'U soo bandhig booqdayaasha luqaddooda adoo adeegsanaya boor yar (marnaba dib-u-hagaajin ha samaynin)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Ka qari bogagga aan la tarjumin matoorada goobidda (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Turjumaadda wali wadata qoraalka asalka ah waxaa laga saaraa natiijooyinka raadinta ilaa laga turjumo.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Qayb ka mid ah Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly waxa uu ku darayaa xiriiriyeyaasha hreflang (oo leh x-default), luuqadda iyo jihada bogga, iyo luuqad kasta khariidadda goobtaada:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Wada shaqeynta: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Eray kasta oo ciwaanka ka mid ah waa 2 ilaa 12 xaraf oo yaryar, lambarro ama xarriiqyo.','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Turjumaadda tooska ah marka la cusboonaysiiyo, doorarka dib-u-eegaha, dhoofinta XLIFF ee turjumayaasha, ka beddelashada WPML, Polylang ama TranslatePress iyo hubinta tayada ee AI waxay la socdaan Tranzly Pro.','When an original changes'=>'Marka asalku isbeddelo','When a page is edited'=>'Marka bogga la beddelo','Mark its translations out of date'=>'U calamadee turjumaannadeeda kuwo dhacay','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Turjum tarjumadiisa mar labaad xagga dambe','Do nothing'=>'Ha samaynin waxba','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'Turjumaad uu qof wax ka beddelay waligeed lama dul qoro; beddelkeeda waxa loo calamadeeyaa mid duugoobay.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'U turjun bogagga cusub luuqad kasta marka la daabaco','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Moodelka labaad ee AI ayaa u akriya tarjumad kasta oo garab socota asalkeeda, dhibco siiya oo magacaaba khaladaadka. Waxay ka isticmaashaa furahaaga AI ee gaarka ah goobaha AI. Ka bilow hubinta Xaaladda tarjumaadda.','AI provider'=>'Bixiyaha AI','The AI settings’ general model'=>'Qaabka guud ee habaynta AI','Recommended'=>'Lagu taliyay','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Boggu wuxuu u baahan yahay eegmo bini\'aadam haddii uu dhibcahan ka hooseeyo','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Daipac kaliya turjumaadaha uu dib-u-eeguhu ansixiyay','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Sii dadka doorka Turjumaanka (wuxuu wax ka beddelaa turjumaadaha, marnaba kuwa asalka ah, ma daabici karo) ama doorka Dib-u-eegaha Turjumaadda (sidoo kale wuu ansixiyaa). Dib-u-eegayaashu waxay sidoo kale ka helaan wax kasta oo sugaya liisaska Qoraallada iyo Bogagga ee hoos yimaada "La sugayo"; daabacaadda mid ka mid ah halkaas ayaa ansixinaysa.','Manage users'=>'Maamul isticmaalayaasha','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Waxba ma sugayaan dib-u-eegis.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Xusuusin turjumaha (ikhtiyaari)','Read side by side'=>'Dhinac-ka-dhinac u akhri','Approve'=>'Oggolow','Ask for changes'=>'Codso isbeddello','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'%d turjummo ayaa la soo dhoofiyay oo laga ilaaliyay turjumaadda mashiinka.','Export and import for translators'=>'Dhoofinta iyo soo dejinta turjumayaasha','Not translated yet'=>'Weli lama tarjumin','Already translated'=>'Horey loo turjumay','Format'=>'Qaab','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (qalabka turjumaada)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (xaashiyaha faafinta)','Download the file'=>'Soo dejiso faylka','Import a translated file'=>'Soo geli fayl la turjumay','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'Laga noqday: %1$d xiriirin ayaa la saaray, %2$d bogag la soo dhoofiyay ayaa la tirtiray.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Tijaabinta socodsiinta, waxba ma beddelmin:','Imported:'=>'La soo dhoofiyay:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'%1$d luqadood ayaa lagu daray, %2$d turjumadood ayaa la xiriiriyay, %3$d bogag ayaa la dhisay, %4$d qoraallo.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Marka hore demi furmaysada (plugin-ka) kale (cinwaanadeeda iyo beddelayaasheeda ayaa iska hor imaanaya Tranzly). Xogteedu waxay ku sii jiraysaa halka ay tahay, si aad dib ugu soo noqon karto; Ka noqoshadu (Undo) waxay si sax ah meesha uga saaraysaa wixii ay soo dejintu ku dartay.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Wax xog ah oo ka timid furahan kuma jiraan goobtan.','Languages: %s'=>'Luqadaha: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'weli wuu shaqaynayaa: marka hore dami.','Dry run'=>'Tijaabada qallalan','Import'=>'Soo dhoofso','Undo the import'=>'Ka noqo soo dejinta','Comments and product reviews'=>'Faallooyinka iyo dib-u-eegista alaabta','Each language keeps its own'=>'Luqad kasta waxay haysataa tiisa gaarka ah','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Muuji faallooyinka luuqad kasta ee nooc kasta','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Dhammaan muuji, iyagoo loo tarjumay luuqadda akhristaha','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Turjumiddu waxay isticmaashaa mashiinka turjumaadda ee aad dooratay faallo kasta oo la ansixiyay. Spam-ka iyo faallooyinka sugaya dib-u-eegista marnaba lama diro.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'Waa la keydiyay. Qaybaha aad beddeshay waxaa lagu calaamadeeyay in qof hubiyay, turjumaddanna waxaa laga ilaaliyay turjumaadda mashiinka.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'Qaabeynta turjumaddan waxa lagu beddelay tifaftiraha, sidaas darteed qaybaha qaar hadda lama jaanqaadayaan asalka. Qaybaha aan wehelka lahayn waxa loo muujiyey inay faaruq yihiin; ku sax inta kale tifaftiraha.','Open the editor'=>'Fur tifaftiraha','Original (%s)'=>'Asalka (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Turjumaad (%s)','This piece has formatting or links, so it is shown with its HTML. Change only the words between the tags.'=>'Qaybtani waxay leedahay qaabayn ama xiriirinno, markaa waxa lagu muujiyay HTML-keeda. Beddel kaliya ereyada u dhexeeya sumadaha.','Save changes'=>'Keydi isbeddellada','Open in the editor'=>'Ku fur tifaftiraha','Checked by a person'=>'Qof ayaa hubiyay','Imported'=>'La soo dhoofiyay','Not in the translation'=>'Kuma jiro tarjumaadda','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ku dar luqad labaad Tranzly hoosteeda qaybta maamulka, beddeluhuna halkan ayuu ka soo muuqan doonaa.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Sida caadiga ah waa dansan yahay: calanku waa dal, ma aha luqad.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Waxa ay akhriyayaasha shaashadu ku dhawaaqaan, tusaale ahaan “Dooro luqad”.','Colours'=>'Midabbada','Not translated'=>'Lama turjumin','Original'=>'Asalka ah','Published'=>'La daabacay','Draft'=>'Qabyo','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Qof ayaa hubiyay, waa la ilaaliyay','Imported, protected'=>'La soo dhoofiyay, la ilaaliyay','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Weli lama tarjumin (koobi)','View'=>'Eeg','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Fur si mar kale loo turjumi karo','Protect'=>'Illaali','Publish the translations'=>'Daipac tarjumaadaha','Translate into %d language'=>'U turjum %d luqadood' . "\0" . 'U turjum %d luqadood','Show this block'=>'Muuji qaybtan','In every language'=>'Luuqad kasta','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Kaliya luqadaha la calaamadeeyay','In every language except those ticked'=>'Luuqad kasta marka laga reebo kuwa la calaamadeeyay','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'Wakiilada AI waa la oggol yahay. Dib u soo geli boggan si aad u aragto qalabka.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'Wakiilada AI waa la damiyay. Cinwaanka xiriirkoodu mar dambe kama jawaabayo.','Image per language'=>'Sawir luqad kasta','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'U muuji sawir kale akhristayaasha luuqad, tusaale ahaan boodhadh ay erayo ku qoran yihiqq.','Replace the %s image'=>'Beddel sawirka %s','Choose a %s image'=>'Dooro sawirka %s','Use the original image'=>'Isticmaal sawirka asalka ah','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','The AI settings\' choice (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Xulashada habaynta AI (%1$s %2$s)','The AI settings\' choice'=>'Xulashada habaynta AI','Choose the AI model that translates each language, for example one model for Japanese and another for German. Languages without a choice of their own use the model for all other languages.'=>'Dooro nooca AI ee turjumaya luqad kasta, tusaale ahaan hal nooc oo Jabbaan ah iyo mid kale oo Jarmal ah. Luqadaha aan lahayn doorasho iyaga u gaar ah waxay isticmaalaan nooca luqadaha kale oo dhan.','AI model for all other languages'=>'Qaabka AI ee dhammaan luqadaha kale','Engine for %s'=>'Matoorka %s','The default engine'=>'Mashiinka caadiga ah','AI model for %s'=>'Qaabka AI ee %s','The model for all other languages'=>'Qaabka luqadaha kale oo dhan','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Haddii engine-ku fashilmo ama uu gaaro xadka, isku day kuwaan xiga, siday u kala horeeyaan','Monthly spending caps'=>'Xadka kharashka bishii','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Marka matoorku gaaro xadkiisa, wax dambe looma diri doono ilaa bisha dambe, warbixinta tarjumada fashilantayna waxay sheegaysaa sababta. Bannaan ku daa haddii aysan jirin wax xad ah.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (la kharash gareeyay bishan: $%2$s)','AI provider %1$s, every language it translates (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'Bixiyaha AI %1$s, luqad kasta oo uu tarjumo (la kharash gareeyay bishan: $%2$s)','Save spending caps'=>'Kaydi xaddidyada kharashka','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Turjumaadaha la doorbiday (midkiiba sadar: erey = turjumaad)','Formality'=>'Rasminimo','Default'=>'Ugu talagal','Formal'=>'Rasmi','Informal'=>'Aan rasmi ahayn','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Tilmaamaha qaabka (dhagaystayaasha, codka astaanta)','Correct this translation'=>'Sax tarjumadan','Saving…'=>'Kaydinayaa…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Qoraal la turjumay. Riix Enter si aad u saxdo.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Guji qoraal kasta oo xariiqan si aad u saxdo tarjamadiisa.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'Boggan lagama helin qoraal la turjumay oo halkan lagu saxo. Taas beddelkeeda isticmaal tifaftiraha dhinac-ka-dhinaca ah.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Beddelaha luuqadda','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Xiriirinta boggan ee mid kasta oo ka mid ah luuqadaha goobta. Waxba ma soo bandhigayo ilaa labo ama wax ka badan oo luuqadood la taxo.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Luqad','block keywordswitcher'=>'Beddele','block keywordtranslation'=>'Turjumid','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Waxay u oggolaanaysaa booqdayaasha inay boggan ku akhriyaan luqad kale oo ka mid ah luqadahaaga: liis, kaniiniyo, badhammo, liiska hoos-u-dhaca ama koodhadhka luqadda, oo leh calamo ikhtiyaari ah.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'Luuqado badan']];